<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Job</book>
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz prae ah Job, tiah kawk ih kami maeto oh; to kami loe coek koi om ai, katoeng kami ah oh; Sithaw zit moe, kahoih ai hmuen ayae koeh kami ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anih loe capa sarihto hoi canu thumto sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuu sang sarih, kaengkuu hrang sang thum, laikok atok thaih maitawtae cumvai pangato, laa hrang cumvai pangato tawnh moe, tamna paroeai a tawnh; anih loe ni angyae bang ih kaminawk boih thungah kalen koek ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih ih capanawk loe saning kruek, angmacae tapenhaih niah angmacae im ah buhraenghaih poih to sak o, to naah a tanuh thumtonawk doeh, nawnto buhcaak hanah kawk o toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Job mah ka caanawk loe palungthin thungah Sithaw to kasae thuih o moe, zae o moeng boeh mue, tiah a poek pongah, buhraenghaih poih boeng pacoengah, nihcae to kawk moe, ciimcaisak; nihcae boih hanah hmai angbawnhaih to akhawnbang kruek a sak pae. Job mah to tiah sak toepsoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nito naah Sithaw ih caanawk loe Angraeng hmaa ah angphong hanah angzoh o, to naah Setan doeh nihcae salakah angzoh toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Angraeng mah Setan khaeah, naa hoiah maw nang zoh? tiah a naa. Setan mah Angraeng khaeah, Long pum ahnuk ahmaa kam het nakung hoiah kang zoh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To pacoengah Angraeng mah Setan khaeah, Ka tamna Job ho na poek vai maw? Long nuiah anih baktih kami mi doeh om ai; anih loe coek koi om ai, katoeng kami ah oh, Sithaw to zit moe, kasae hmuen sak koeh ai kami ah oh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Setan mah Angraeng khaeah, Job loe tidoeh na ai ah Sithaw to zit maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih hoi a imthung takoh, a tawnh ih hmuennawk boih loe sipae baktiah na pakaa pae na ai maw? A toksakhaih nuiah tahamhoihaih na paek pongah, anih loe prae thungah hmuenmae paroeai angraeng boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toe vaihiah na ban phok ah loe, a tawnh ih hmuennawk boih paro pae ah, anih mah na hmaa roe ah nang to kasae thui tih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Angraeng mah Setan khaeah, Khenah, a tawnh ih hmuennawk boih na ban ah oh; toe angmah to loe na ban hoi sui hmah, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nito naah Job capa hoi canunawk loe amya nongpa kacoeh koek im ah buhcaak o moe, misurtui a naek o nathuem ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job khaeah laicaeh maeto angzoh moe, Na tamnanawk loe maitawtae hoiah laikok atok o moe, a taengah laa hrangnawk rawkcak caak o li naah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabean kaminawk to angzoh o moe, tuk o pacoengah, maetawtaenawk hoi laa hrangnawk to lak pae o king; ue, nihcae mah na tamnanawk to sumsen hoiah hum o, nang khaeah tamthang thuih hanah kai khue ni loih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih mah lokthuih li naah, kalah laicaeh maeto angzoh let moe, Van hoiah Sithaw ih hmai krak tathuk moe, nang ih tuunawk hoi na tamnanawk to kangh boih, nang khaeah tamthang thuih hanah kai khue ni loih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih mah lokthuih li naah, kalah laicaeh maeto angzoh let moe, Khaldea kaminawk abu thumto ah angzoh o, kaengkuu hrangnawk to lak o moe, hoih o ving boeh, na tamnanawk loe sumsen hoiah hum o; nang khaeah tamthang thuih hanah kai khue ni loih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih mah lokthuih li naah, laicaeh kalah maeto angzoh let, laicaeh mah anih khaeah, Na capa hoi na canunawk loe amya kacoeh koek im ah buhcaak o moe, misurtui naek o nathuem ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khenah, praezaek hoiah takhi to song moe, im to hmuh phaeng, im mah nawktanawk to taeh pongah, nihcae loe duek o boih; nang khaeah tamthang thuih hanah kai khue ni loih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hae lok thaih naah, Job loe angthawk moe, angmah ih kahni to asih, sam to aah moe, long ah tabok hoiah Sithaw to a bok,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />anih mah, Kam no zok thung hoi bangkrai ah kang zoh, bangkrai ah kam laem let han; Angraeng mah ang paek moe, Angraeng mah lak let boeh; Angraeng ih ahmin tahamhoihaih om nasoe, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih loe hae baktih tahamsethaih hmuennawk boih to tongh, toe Job loe zaehaih sah ai; Sithaw doeh kasae thui ai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni kalah nito naah, Angraeng hmaa ah amtueng hanah Sithaw ih caanawk to angzoh o, Setan doeh Angraeng hmaa ah amtueng hanah nihcae hoi nawnto angzoh toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Angraeng mah Setan khaeah, naa hoiah maw nang zoh? tiah a naa. Setan mah Angraeng khaeah, Long pum ahnuk ahmaa kam het nakung hoiah kang zoh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To pacoengah Angraeng mah Setan khaeah, Ka tamna Job ho na poek vai maw? Anih baktih kami long nuiah mi doeh om ai; anih loe coek koi om ai, katoeng kami ah oh, Sithaw to zit moe, kasae hmuen sak koeh ai kami ah oh; tidoeh na ai ah anih amrosak hanah kai nang zoek cadoeh, anih loe oepthok kami ah ni oh poe, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Setan mah Angraeng khaeah, Ahin hanah ahin, tiah thuih ih lok baktih toengah, kami maeto mah a tawnh ih hmuen to a hinghaih hanah paek boih tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe vaihi na ban to phok ah loe, anih ih ngan hoi ahuh to sui ah, na hmaa roe ah nang hae kasae thui tih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Angraeng mah Setan khaeah, Khenah, anih loe na ban ah oh, toe a hinghaih to pathlung ah, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To pongah Setan loe Angraeng hmaa hoi tacawt moe, Job to khokpadae hoi lu khoek to ahlut mansak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Job loe tak tahawh haih hanah kakoi long laom to lak moe, maiphu thungah anghnut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zu mah anih khaeah, Katoeng kami ah maw na oh poe han vop? Sithaw to pasoih ah loe dueh khae, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toe anih mah a zu khaeah, Kamthu koek nongpata baktiah lok na paeh; Sithaw khae hoi kahoih hmuen a hak o baktih toengah, kasae hmuen doeh a hak o mak ai maw? tiah a naa. Hae hmuennawk boih a tongh, toe Job loe pahni hoiah mataeng doeh zaehaih sah ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Job nuiah kaom kasae hmuennawk kawng to ampui thumtonawk mah thaih o; Teman acaeng Eliphaz, Shuh acaeng Bildad hoi Naamath acaeng Zophar cae loe angmacae im hoiah angzoh o; anih to palungset o haih moe, pathloep hanah ani to khaeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nihcae mah kangthla hoiah khet o naah, Job to maat o ai boeh; nihcae loe tha hoiah qah o; angmacae ih kahni to asih o moe, angmacae lu nuiah krak hanah maiphu to van ah a haeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To tiah nihcae mah Job to long ah ni sarihto hoi qum sarihto thung anghnut o haih, anih patangkhanghaih loe nat pae hmoek pongah, mi mah doeh anih to lok tapring o ai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hae tiah oh pacoengah, Job mah pakha aangh moe, angmah tapenhaih ni to kasae thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Job mah hae tiah thuih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka tapenhaih ni hae amro nasoe, ca nongpa pomh boeh, tiah thuihaih aqum to amro nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To ni to khoving nasoe; ranui bang ih Sithaw mah tidoeh sah pae hmah nasoe; a nuiah aanghaih doeh om hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vinghaih hoi duekhaih tahlip mah to ani to kai ih ani ni, tiah thui o nasoe; a nuiah tamai amzam nasoe loe, kaving ani mah pazih nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To ni to vinghaih kathah mah khuk khoep nasoe; saningto thung kaom aninawk thungah athum hmah nasoe loe, kawbaktih khrah thungah doeh kroek ah om hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khenah, to aqum loe angqai krang nasoe loe, a thungah anghoehaih lok om hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani tangoeng kami, palungsethaih angthawksak thaih kaminawk mah to aqum to tangoeng o nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akhawnbang cakaehnawk loe ving o nasoe loe, a zing o ih khodai to hnu o hmah nasoe, akhawnbang khodai doeh hnu o hmah nasoe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />raihaih ka tongh han ai ah, aqum mah kam no ih zok to pakaa ai pongah kasae ah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tipongah maw zok thungah ka duek moe, tapen tangsuek naah kam ro ving ai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tih han ih khokkhu nuiah ang tapom moe, naek hanah tahnu ang pazohsak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To tiah na sah ai nahaeloe vaihi loe kamongah kang song moe, kang hngai duem han boeh; ka iip ueloe, kang hak tih boeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />angmacae amro haih hanah toksah long siangpahrangnawk hoi angraengnawk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe sui katawn mangh, im koimong ah sumkanglung kasuem ukkungnawk hoi nawnto ka laem tih boeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe khrah akoep ai ah tapen nawkta baktih, aanghaih hnu vai ai nawkta baktiah amro han ka koeh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />To duekhaih ahmuen ah loe kasae kaminawk mah raihaih paek mak ai boeh; patangkhang kaminawk doeh anghak o tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To ahmuen ah loe thongkrah kaminawk doeh nawnto anghak o; pacaekthlaek kami ih lok to thaih o ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />To ahmuen ah loe kami kalen doeh, kathoeng doeh nawnto oh o moe, tamna doeh angmah ih angraeng ban thung hoiah loih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tipongah maw patangkhang kami hanah aanghaih paek moe, poeksae kami hanah hinghaih to paek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Patangkhang kaminawk loe atho kana hmuennawk pakrong pongah duek han ih koeh o kue, toe dueh o thai ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nihcae mah taprong hnuk o naah, paroeai anghoe o moe, nawm o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tipongah maw a caehhaih loklam anghmang kami hoi Sithaw mah pakaa ih kami khaeah hinghaih to paek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Buhcaak zuengah kana ahamhaih lok to oh, kana hanghaih lok loe tui baktiah long.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka zit parai ih hmuen to ka nuiah phak boeh, ka zit ih hmuen kai khaeah angzoh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kai loe monghaih tawn ai, anghakhaih doeh ka tawn ai; raihaih hoiah ni ka oh sut boeh, tiah a thuih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Teman acaeng Eliphaz mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />lok kang thuih o nahaeloe, na thaima doeh om tih, toe mi maw lokthui ai ah om thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khenah, kami paroeai na thuitaek boeh, thacak ai kaminawk ih ban to tha na caksak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amtimh kami to na lok hoiah na patawnh moe, thacak khokkhu to tha na caksak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe na nuiah raihaih phak moe, palung na boeng sut boeh; ang boh moe, raihaih na tongh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hae loe sithaw na zithaih, na oephaih hoi toenghaih loklam ah na ai maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zaehaih tawn ai kami loe amro vai maw? To tih ai boeh loe kawbaktih ahmuen ah maw katoeng kami amro vaih? Tito poek ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hnuk ih baktih toengah, kahoih ai hmuen sah kami, sethaih aanmu haeh kami ni, a sak ih baktih toengah aah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To baktih kaminawk loe Sithaw ih palungphuihaih hoiah amro o moe, Sithaw anghahhaih takhi hoiah duek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae loe kasan kaipui ih lok baktih, kaipui baktiah hang o cadoeh, kaipui haa kangkhaek baktiah amro o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kaipui mitong loe caak han moi om ai pongah duek, a caanawk loe anghmaa angtaa o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaihi kai khaeah tamquta hoi lok ang thuih, thuih duem ih lok to ka thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaminawk loe iih o boih boeh, qum amang ah hnuksakhaih to ka poek naah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />zithaih ka nuiah phak naah, ka huhnawk anghuenh khoek to tasoeh takuenhaih hoiah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hmaa ah muithla caeh pongah; ka nganmui angthawk tahang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />to muithla loe angdoet sut, krang loe kahoih ah amtueng ai, krang tahlip khue ni ka hnuk; to naah kamding rue, to pacoengah ka thaih ih lok maeto mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kadueh thaih kami loe Sithaw pongah toeng kue maw? Kami loe anih sahkung pongah ciim kue maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw mah loe a tamnanawk maeto mataeng doeh oep ai; angmah ih vankaminawk mataeng doeh sakpazaehaih hnu nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tangphrung long hoiah sak ih im ah kaom, karaa pongah amro han kazoi kue, maiphu hoiah sak ih kaminawk cae loe kawkruk maw sakpazaehaih hnu pae tih!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nihcae loe akhawnbang hoi duembang salakah amro o moe, mi mah doeh panoek ai ah dungzan khoek to anghmat o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nihcae hoihhaih loe anghmat moe, nihcae loe palunghahaih tawn ai ah duek o na ai maw? tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaihi kawk noek ah, na kawkhaih lok pathim han kami om tih maw? Naa bang ih kaciim kaminawk khaeah maw nang qoi han?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Palungphui hmai baktih amngaehhaih mah kamthu to hum moe, uthaih mah kamthu to misong ah ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kamthu ih tangzun loe cak, tiah ka hnuk pongah, a ohhaih ahmuen to ka tangoeng pae roep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih ih caanawk loe misa monghaih tawn o ai, khongkha ah ah atit o naah, bomkung tawn o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A aah ih cang loe zok amthlam kaminawk mah caak pae o ving; anih ih hmuenmaenawk loe mingcahnawk mah lomh pae o king.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Patangkhanghaih loe maiphu thung hoiah angzo ai, raihaih doeh long thung hoiah tacawt ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toe van bangah tapraek tahang hmai baktih toengah, kami loe raihaih tongh han ih ni tapen roe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toe kai loe Sithaw khaeah tahmenhaih ka hnik moe, ka raihaih to Sithaw khaeah ka tathlang han:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />anih loe paroeai kalen hmuen, kroek laek ai hmuen, dawnrai koi hmuennawk to sak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih mah ni long ah kho angzohsak moe, lawk ah tui to longsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Poek pahnaem kami to anih mah atoengh tahang moe, palungsae kami to monghaih ahmuen ah atoengh tahang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minawk aling thaih kami mah kasae pacaeng ih hmuen akoep han ai ah, anih mah pakaa pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Palungha kaminawk loe angmacae palunghahaih hoiah sak pacaeng ih hmuen pongah amansak moe, poek kangkawn kami amsakhaih to a phraek pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nihcae loe khodai ah vinghaih tongh o moe, athun ah khoving baktiah loklam pathoep hoiah a caeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sithaw mah amtang kaminawk to thacak kami ih pakha hoi anih ih ban thung hoiah pahlong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To pongah amtang kaminawk loe oephaih tawnh o moe, katoeng ai hmuen mah anih ih pakha to tamuep pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw mah patoengh ih kami loe tahamhoih; to pongah Thacak koek Sithaw mah thuitaekhaih to patoek hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih mah ahmaa caksak, toe ahmaa to komh pae let; nganbawh kana a paek, toe ngantuisak let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih mah vai tarukto raihaih thung hoiah na loisak tih; ue, vai sarihto naah doeh kasae na tongh mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih mah khokhaa naah duekhaih thung hoiah na pahlong tih; misatuk naah doeh sumsen thacakhaih thung hoiah pahlong tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lok amlai palai thung hoiah na pakaa ueloe, amrohaih phak naah, na zii mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amrohaih hoi khokhaahaih to na pahnui thuih ueloe, long nui ih hmawsaeng moinawk doeh na zii mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azawn ih thlungnawk loe lokmaihaih ampui baktiah om ueloe, taw ih moisannawk loe kamongah nang hoi nawnto om o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ohhaih kahni im loe misa monghaih hoiah oh, tiah na panoek ueloe, na ohhaih ahmuen na phak naah, palungboenghaih om mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang ih atiinawk loe paroeai pop o tih, na caanawk loe long ih phroh baktiah om o tih, tiah na panoek tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Atue phak naah aah ih cang baktiah, na mitong naah loe taprong ah na caeh tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khenah, hae hmuen hae ka pakrong o, to hmuen loe oh tangtang; to pongah tahngai ah loe, na hoih haih hanah pakuem ah, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Palung ka sethaih hoi raihaih loe tah thai mak ai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuipui ih savuet pongah doeh azit kue, to pongah ni kamthlai hmoek ah lok ka paeh moeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thacak Sithaw ih palaanawk mah kai to cop moe, ka pakhra mah kasoe tui to naek; zitthok Sithaw thacakhaih loe ka hmaa ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Qam caak naah taw ih laa hrang hang maw? Caak han phroh oh naah maitawtae ambuu maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kakhraem ai caaknaek paloi ai ah caak thai maw? To tih ai boeh loe aadui tui kanglung pongah khraemhaih oh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pakhra mah to baktih caaknaek sui hanah koeh ai; to baktih caaknaek loe palungsethaih caaknaek ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw ka hnik ih hmuen to hak nasoe, ka koeh ih hmuen to Sithaw mah na paek nasoe!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sithaw mah kai hae paro nasoe, tiah koehhaih ka tawnh; a ban phok nasoe loe, na takroek pat halat nasoe!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To tiah ni monghaih ka tawn tih, ue, palungsethaih ka pauep han, kai hae na tahmen hmah nasoe; Ciimcai Sithaw ih loknawk to ka aek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thacakhaih ka tawn ai boeh, timaw ka oep khing han vop? Saning kasawk ah ka hing cadoeh tih oephaih maw oh vop?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thacakhaih loe thlung thacakhaih ah maw oh? To tih ai boeh loe kai ih angan loe sumkamling ngan maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai loe kaimah hoi kaimah kang bomh thai ai, ka palunghahaih doeh boeng boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Patangkhang kami loe angmah ih ampui mah tahmenhaih amtuengsak han oh; toe anih mah tahmen ai nahaeloe, anih loe Lensawk Sithaw zithaih tawn ai kami ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kam nawkamyanawk loe kalen moe, kakang let vacong tui baktiah aling thaih kami ah oh o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />to tui loe kamkhawk tui, amtueng ai ah kamzawt dantui mah lensak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />toe to tui loe nipui tue ah kang moe, ni kabae mah amzawtsak boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To vacongnawk loe angmacae longhaih loklam to anghmang o, loklam ai ah a long o moe, anghmat angtaa o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tema ih kaminawk mah tui to pakrong o, Sheba prae hoi kholong caeh kaminawk mah tui to oephaih hoiah zing o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nihcae oephaih tawnh o, toe palungboeng o ving; to ah phak o naah, palungboeng o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />To baktih toengah nangcae doeh azom pui ni, tiah amtueng boeh; ka tongh ih raihaih na hnuk o naah, na zit o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kai khaeah bokhaih tangqum to sin oh, to tih ai boeh loe na tawnh o ih hmuenmae thung hoiah tangqum na paek oh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />misa ban thung hoiah na pahlong oh loe, thacak kami ban thung hoiah na krang oh, tiah ka thuih vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka sak pazaehaih na patuek oh, kang hngaiduem han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toenghaih lok loe thacak! Toe kasae nang aek o ih lok mah timaw angcoengsak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thuih ih loknawk kasaethuih hanah na poek o maw, oephaih tawn ai kami mah thuih ih lok loe takhi baktih maw na poek o?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ue, ampa tawn ai kaminawk to na pacaekthlaek o moe, nam puinawk hanah quum na qaih pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />To pongah na khen oh; nangcae hmaa ah lok kam lai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khopoek o let rae ah, zaehaih net o hmah; ue, khopoek o let raeh; kai loe toenghaih hoiah ni tok ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka palai ah sethaih akap maw? Kai loe kasae kahoih pathlaeng thai ai kami ah maw ka oh?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kami loe thanathaih hoiah na ai maw long nuiah toksak? A hinghaih ninawk doeh toksak han tlai ih kami ih ninawk baktiah na ai maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamna mah tahlip to zing moe, tlai ih toksah kami mah toktho zing baktih toengah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kai doeh khrah paroeai thungah ka sak ih tok loe azom pui ah ni oh, aqumnawk doeh kai patangkhanghaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka iih naah, natuek naah maw aqum hae boeng ueloe, kang thawk han? tiah ka poek; to tiah akhawnbang khodai khoek to ahnuk ahmaa kam let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngan loe alungh hoi maiphu mah khuk khoep boeh; ka nganhin loe akah rak moe, ahnai to tacawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hinghaih aninawk loe kahni sah kami ih camprai pongah rang kue moe, oephaih om ai ah laemh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ka hinghaih loe takhi ah ni oh, tiah panoek ah; ka mik mah hoihhaih roe hnu mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaihi kai hnu kaminawk mah, kai na hnu o let mak ai boeh; nang khet naah, ka om mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kanghmaa tamai baktiah, taprong ah caeh tathuk kami loe, amlaem let mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih loe angmah im ah amlaem let mak ai boeh; a ohhaih ahmuen mah doeh anih to panoek mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To pongah pakha hae kang sumh mak ai; patangkhang ka muithla hoiah lok ka thuih moe, khosak kasae ka hinghaih hoiah lok ka thuih han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai loe tuipui ah maw ka oh, tuipui thung ih tanga pui ah maw ka oh moe, kai toepkung na suek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka iihkhun mah kamongah anghaksak ueloe, kang song naah ka nathaih hoikhang tih mue, tiah ka poek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />to naah amaang sae mah kai ang pazih, hnuksakhaih mah ang tasoehsak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />to pongah ka hing pongah loe, tahnong panamh moe, duek to ka koeh kue boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hinghaih hae ka panuet; ka hing poe mak ai; kaimabueng na omsak ah; ka hinghaih aninawk loe avanghaih tidoeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kami loe kawbangah maw oh moe, anih to na pakoeh? Anih to na poek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih to akhawnbang kruek na paqaih thuih moe, anih to na tanoek tuektuek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai caeh taak ai ah nasetto maw na oh han vop, kaimah ih tamtui paaeh karoek to, kaimabueng nang omsak mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw kaminawk toepkung, kai loe ka zae boeh maw? Na hmaa ah timaw ka sak? Tipongah kaimah han hmuenzit ah ka oh hanah, kah han na patoep ih hmuen ah nang suek loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tipongah ka sakpazaehaih nang tahmen ai, ka zaehaih doeh nang takhoe pae ving ai loe? Kai loe vaihi maiphu pongah kang song han boeh; akhawnbangah nang pakrong tih, toe ka om mak ai boeh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Shuh acaeng Bildah mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hae baktih hmuen kawngnawk hae vai nazetto maw na thuih han vop? Na pakha hoi tacawt loknawk loe nasetto maw takhi baktiah thacak vop tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sithaw loe katoeng ai ah lokcaek maw? Katoeng ah lokcaekhaih to Thacak Sithaw mah phrae ving tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na caanawk mah a nuiah hmuen sakpazae o pongah, a sakpazae o haih baktih toengah, anih mah nihcae to thuitaek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />toe Sithaw khaeah nang qoi moe, Thacak Sithaw khaeah tahmenhaih na hnik nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na ciim moe, na toeng nahaeloe, vaihi nang hanah angthawk ueloe, katoengah kho na sakhaih ahmuen to qoengsak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nam tong tangsuek naah thoengkae cadoeh, hnukkhuem ah loe lensawkhaih hoiah na qoeng tahang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kalaem tangcae atue to dueng ah, nam panawk mah tongh o ih hmuennawk to dueng ah loe poek ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(aicae loe zangduem ah ni tapen o vop, to pongah tidoeh a panoek o ai, long nuiah aicae khosakhaih aninawk loe tahlip ah ni oh.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae mah loe palung tang hoi patuk ueloe, na thuitaek o mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cakrungkung baktih akung loe tangnong om ai ahmuen ah amprawk thai maw? Tui taeng ih phroh loe tui om ai ah ampraek thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To akung loe amprawk tahang naah, aqam hing suep pongah mi mah doeh aat ai; toe kalah qam pongah azaem zoi kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sithaw pahnet kaminawk caehhaih loklam doeh to tiah oh; Sithaw tidoeh sah ai kami oephaih loe amro tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nihcae oephaih loklam loe amro tih, nihcae amhahaih loe bongpaha tazae baktiah ni om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih loe angmah im ah amha, toe angdoe thai ai; a ban hoi patawnh, toe cak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To baktih kami loe ni bet naah hing suep moe, tanghang mah takha to khuk boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tangzun mah thlung to zaeng boih moe, thlung salakah tangzun sakhaih ahmuen to pakrong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toe kami mah a ohhaih ahmuen hoiah aphongh ving naah loe, a ohhaih ahmuen mah anih khaeah, Nang hae kang hnuh vai ai, tiah naa ueloe, angphat taak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khenah, anih anghoehaih loklam loe to tiah oh; anih amprawkhaih ahmuen ah, kalah thingnawk to amprawk o lat tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khenah, coek koi om ai kami to Sithaw mah haek ai; kasae hmuen sah kami doeh abomh ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />anih mah na pakha to pahnuisak ueloe, na pahni to anghoehaih hoiah koisak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang hnuma kaminawk to azatsak tih, kasae kami ohhaih im to anghma tih boeh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />to lok loe amsoem, tiah ka panoek; toe kami loe kawbangmaw Sithaw hmaa ah toeng thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kami mah anih hoi lok angaek han koeh cadoeh, vai sangto thungah vaito mataeng doeh pathim thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sithaw loe palunghahaih, thacakhaih hoiah koi; palung thah, anih ih lok aek kami loe khosak hoihaih hnuk vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sithaw palungphui naah, nihcae panoek ai ah maenawk to angthuisak moe, amletsak thaih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />long to angthuisak hanah ahuenh moe, tungnawk to anghuensak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni tacawt han ai ah lok a thuih pae; cakaehnawk aanghaih to vingh pae khoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih mah khue ni vannawk to payuengh moe, tuipui tuiphunawk to cawh thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih loe Arcturus, Orian, Pleiades cakaehnawk hoi aloih bang ih cakaehnawk Sahkung ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih loe panoek thai ai kalen hmuennawk to sak; ue, kroek laek ai dawnraihaih doeh a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khenah, anih ka taengah caeh naah, ka hnu thai ai; a caeh poe naah, anih to ka panoek thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khenah, anih mah la ving nahaeloe, mi mah maw pakaa thai tih? Mi mah maw anih khaeah, Timaw na sak? tiah thui thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sithaw palungphuihaih dip ai nahaeloe, amoek kami thapaek kaminawk loe anih hmaa ah ni akuep o sut tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawbangmaw anih ih lok to ka pathim thai tih? Anih hoi lok angaek hanah kawbaktih lok maw ka qoih han?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zaehaih ka tawn ai langlacadoeh, anih to ka aek thai mak ai; lokcaekkung khaeah loe tahmenhaih khue ni ka hnik thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih to ka kawk moe, ka kawkhaih lok na pathim pae aep to mah, anih mah ka lok na tahngai pae tih, tiah ka poek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih mah takhi sae hoiah ang boh moe, takung om ai ah nganbawh kana ang pungsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kai han anghahhaih takhi na paek ai, kakhaa patangkhanghaih hoiah ni ang koisak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thacakhaih kawng thuih nahaeloe, khenah, anih loe thacak koek ah oh! Toenghaih hoi lokcaek naah doeh, mi mah maw lokcaekhaih im ah kai han lok pathim pae tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zaehaih tawn ai ah ka oh langlacadoeh, ka pakha mah zaehaih na net tih; coek koi om ai ah ka oh, tiah ka thuih cadoeh, ka poek angkawnhaih to amtuengsak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Coek koi om ai ah ka oh cadoeh, ka poekhaih ka panoek thai ai; ka hinghaih hae tiah doeh ka poek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maeto kaom kanghmong hmuen loe, Coek koi om ai kami doeh, kasae kami doeh, amro hmaek tih, tiah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Poek ai pui hoi kami to boh maat naah, anih mah zaehaih tawn ai kami nuiah lokcaekhaih to pahnui thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Long loe kasae kami ban ah paek moe, lokcaekkungnawk to mikmaengsak; to hmuen to Sithaw mah sah ai nahaeloe, mi mah maw sah tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hinghaih aninawk loe ca phawkung pongah doeh rang o kue; nihcae loe hoihhaih hnu ai ah, cawnh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />To aninawk loe cawnh karang palongpui baktiah laemh o moe, moi cop hanah karangah kazawk tahmu baktiah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Laisaephaih ka pahnet han boeh, poekraihaih ka toengh moe, ka pahnui han boeh, tiah ka thuih cadoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ka tongh ih patangkhanghaih to ka zit, kai hae zaehaih tawn ai kami ni, tiah Na poek mak ai, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kahoih ai kami ah ka oh nahaeloe, tih hanah azom pui ah tok ka sak khing vop loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka takpum hae dantui hoi kam saeh moe, ka ban hae kaciim ah kam saeh cadoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sithaw mah tangnong thungah na va ueloe, ka khukbuen mah ka takpum hae panuet tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lokcaekhaih ahmuen ah nawnto a caeh o moe, a lok pathim hanah, Sithaw loe kai baktiah om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aihnik lokcaek hmaek hanah, aicae salakah kaom kami mi doeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lokcaekhaih angmah ih cung to kai khae hoiah la ving nasoe loe, zitthok a sak ih hmuen mah na pazih hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe anih zithaih tawn ai ah lok to ka thuih han; toe vaihi loe lok ka thui thai ai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka pakhra mah ka hinghaih hmawt sut boeh; to pongah laisaephaih ai ah loe ka om thai ai, ka hingh patangkhanghaih hae nang khaeah kang thuih han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sithaw khaeah, Zaehaih na net hmah, tipongah misa ah nang suek loe, na thui ah, tiah ka naa han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minawk pacaekthlaek moe, na ban hoi sak ih hmuen to patoekhaih pacoengah, kasae kaminawk poekhaih to nang hoe haih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang loe long taksa mik maw na tawnh? To tih ai boeh loe kami mah hnuk ih baktiah maw na hnuk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang ih aninawk loe kadueh thaih kaminawk ih ani baktiah maw oh? Nang ih saningnawk doeh kami ih saning baktiah maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tipongah ka sakpazaehaih hoi ka zaehaih to na pakrong loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai loe kasae kami na ai ni, tiah na panoek; mi mah doeh na ban thung hoi pahlong thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka takpum boih hae na ban hoiah ni nang sak, ka tungkrang doeh nang ohsak; toe vaihi nam rosak han boeh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kai hae tangphrung long baktiah ni nang sak, tiah pahnet hmah; vaihi maiphu ah maw nam laemsak let han boeh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai hae maitaw tahnutui baktiah nang kraih moe, maitaw tahnutui kamkhawk baktiah nam khawksak boeh na ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai hanah agan hoi ahin to nang khuksak moe, ahuh hoi thaquinawk hoiah nang zaeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinghaih hoi tahmenhaih kai hanah nang paek, ka muithla hae nang khetzawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe hae hmuennawk thui ai ah palung thungah na suek; na palung thungah hae hmuen hae oh, tiah ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka zae nahaeloe, ka zaehaih to na pakuem moe, ka zaehaih baktih toengah dan nang paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kahoih ai kami ah ka oh nahaeloe, khosak bing boeh! Toenghaih hoi ka oh cadoeh, pakoehhaih ka hnu ai. Patangkhanghaih ka poek loiah ka zat sut boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kang thawk tahang naah, zoep ih hmawsaeng kaipui baktiah nang zoep moe, zitthok hmuen ka nuiah nam tuengsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai kasae thuih koeh kami na tawnh mangh, ka nuiah palungphuihaih na thap aep; kai tuk han koeh paroeai misa to nang zoh haih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tipongah kam no zok thung hoiah nang tacawtsak loe? Ka duek ving nahaeloe, mi mah doeh na hnu mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kaom vai ai baktiah ka om ueloe, kam no zok thung hoiah taprong ah na caeh o haih tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai ih atue loe setta ah na ai maw oh boeh? Ka phak pacoengah kam laem let han ai ih prae, duekhaih tahlip mah khuk ih vinghaih prae ah ka caeh ai naah, nawnetta thung, kaimabueng monghaih hoiah ka oh hanah, na caeh taak ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />to prae loe aqum baktih khovinghaih prae, hmuen boih angmah ih ahmuen ah kaom ai, duekhaih tahlip ahmuen, aanghaih to vinghaih ah kaom prae ni, tiah ka thuih han, tiah anih mah pathim pae.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Namaat acaeng Zophar mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />pop parai loknawk hae pathim han ai boeh maw? Lokthui thaih kami to a zaehaih thung hoiah loisak han oh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lok nam laihaih mah minawk lokpae ai ah anghgaisak duem thai tih maw? Kami na pahnui thuih naah, nang azatpaw han thuitaek kami om mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang mah, Ka thuih ih lok loe toeng, Sithaw hmaa ah ka ciim, tiah na thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah lokthui nasoe loe, na pahni to paong pae nasoe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih mah panoek karai alet hnetto palunghahaih amtuengsak nasoe; to tiah ni na sakpazaehaih baktiah na tongh han ih hmuen pong tamsi ah Sithaw mah dan ang paek, tiah na panoek tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kathuk Sithaw ih hmuen to na hnuk thai maw? Thacak Sithaw akoephaih na panoek thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vannawk pongah kasang, timaw na sah thai tih? Hell pongah kathuk kue, timaw na panoek thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To kathuk hmuennawk tahhaih loe long pongah sawk kue moe, tuipui pongah doeh kawk kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sithaw mah naeh maw, thong pakhrak maw, to tih ai boeh loe lok maw na caek nahaeloe, mi mah maw pakaa thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sithaw loe tidoeh avang ai kami to panoek; sakpazae ih hmuen doeh a hnuk; to tiah nahaeloe anih mah to hmuen to poek ai ah om tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toe taw ih laa hrang to kami baktiah tapen naah ni, tidoeh avang ai kami loe palungha thai vop tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe palungthin nam khraih moe, angmah khaeah ban na payangh pacoengah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na ban ah sakpazaehaih om cadoeh, to zaehaih to na vah ving moe, na ohhaih kahni im ah sethaih na omsak ai nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />coek koi om ai ah na mikhmai amtueng tih; ue, zithaih om ai ah, kacakah nang doe tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />raihaih to na pahnet ueloe, kalaem tangcae tui baktiah ni na poek tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hinghaih loe athun ih ni aengh pongah aang kue tih; vaihi kaving ah na oh cadoeh, akhawnbang baktiah aang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oephaih oh pongah, monghaih hoiah na om tih; ue, angmah na khenzawn ueloe, ngancuem ah nang hak tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang song naah, mi mah doeh zithaih na paek mak ai; ue, kami paroeai mah na ven o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toe kasae kami ih mik loe thazok tih, loih o mak ai; nihcae oephaih doeh dueh ving tih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangcae loe kami ah na oh o pongah, palunghahaih hoiah nawnto na dueh o tih, tiah palunghaeng han om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai doeh nangcae baktiah poekhaih ka tawnh toeng; nangcae pongah ka hnaem kue ai; ue, mi maw hae baktih hmuennawk panoek ai ah kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sithaw ka kawk naah, anih mah ang pathimh; toe ka imtaeng kami mah ang pahnui thuih; katoeng kami hoi coek koi om ai kami loe pahnuithuihaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmaiim baktiah khosak hoih kami mah raihaih katong amtimh tom kami to pahnuithuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmuenmae taek kaminawk ih kahni im loe qoeng tahang, Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk loe ngancuem o; Sithaw mah a ban hoiah angraenghaih to paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toe vaihi moisannawk to dueng oh, nihcae mah na patuk tih; van ih tavaanawk to dueng oh, nihcae mah na thui o tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe long to dueng oh, anih mah na patuek ueloe, tuipui tanganawk mah na thui o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hae hmuennawk loe Angraeng mah ni a ban hoiah sak, tiah moisannawk mah mataeng doeh panoek o na ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sak ih hmuennawk boih ih hinghaih hoi kami anghahhaih takhi loe a ban ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pakha mah caaknaek pataengh baktih toengah, naa mah loknawk to tanoek na ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saning coeh kami loe palunghahaih hoiah koi; saning kasawk ah hing kami loe panoek thaihaih to tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe Sithaw loe palunghahaih hoi thacakhaih hoiah akoep; palunghahaih hoi panoek thaihaih doeh anih ih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khenah, anih mah phraek ih hmuen loe, mi mah doeh sah let thai ai boeh; anih mah pakhrak ih kami loe, mi mah doeh loisak thai ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khenah, anih mah tui pakaa naah, tui to kaang; anih mah paongh naah, long loe tui hoiah koi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih loe thacakhaih hoi palunghahaih hoiah koi; aling kami hoi aling kop kami doeh angmah ban ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih mah kahoih poekhaih paek kaminawk to amrosak moe, lokcaek kaminawk to amthusak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih mah siangpahrangnawk to takhoe moe, kazii hoiah zaeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih mah qaimanawk to takhoe moe, thacak kami to amtimsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih mah oepthok kahoih poekhaih paek kaminawk ih pahni to tamuep pae moe, kacoehtanawk khopoek thaihaih to lak pae ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih mah angraengnawk to azatpawsak moe, thacak kaminawk to thazoksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih mah khoving thung hoiah kathuk hmuennawk to amtuengsak moe, duekhaih tahlip to aanghaih thungah zaeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Prae kaminawk to lensak moe, amrosak let; praenawk to kaawksak moe, tamcaeksak let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Long zaehoikungnawk ih palunghahaih to a lak pae ving moe, loklam om ai praezaek ah amhetsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nihcae loe aanghaih kaom ai khoving thungah pathoep hoiah avah o moe, mu paqui kami baktiah ahnuk ahmaa amtimh hoiah lam caeh o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khenah, hae hmuennawk hae ka mik mah hnuk boeh; ka naa mah thaih moe, panoek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na panoek ih hmuen to, ka panoek toeng; nang pongah ka hnaem kue ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toe Thacak Sithaw khaeah ka thuih moe, Sithaw hoi angaek hanah ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toe nangcae loe amsawnlok thui kami, tidoeh avang ai siboi ah ni na oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lok apae ai ah na oh o duem nahaeloe, nangmacae palunghahaih ah om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thuih han ih lok to tahngai oh loe, pahni hoiah ka thuih han ih lok hae tahngai oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sithaw kasae na thuih o han maw? Anih to na ling o han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih mikhmai maw na khet o han? Sithaw han lok na aek pae o han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih mah ang khet o naah hoih, tiah thui tih maw? Kami aling baktiah Sithaw to aling thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamquta hoi mikhmai na khet o nahaeloe, anih mah na thuitaek o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lensawkhaih loe nang han zitthok ai maw? Anih zit thohhaih na nuiah krah mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangcae panoek thaihaih loe maiphu baktiah ni oh, nangcae abuephaih ahmuen doeh long hoiah sak ih abuephaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anghngai o duem ah, lok ka thuih han vop; to pacoengah kawbaktih hmuen doeh ka nuiah pha nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toe kai loe ka ngan hae kaek moe, ka hinghaih hae ban hoi ka sin han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih mah kai na hum cadoeh, a nuiah oephaih ka tawn vop tih; a hmaa ah zae loihhaih lok to ka thuih han vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih loe kai pahlonghaih ah om tih; amoek kaminawk loe a hmaa ah angzo o mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lok hae palung tang hoi tahngai oh; ka thuih ih lok hae naa patueng oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khenah, vaihi kaimah kawng taphong hanah ka oh coek, ka zaehaih loih tih boeh, tiah ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi mah maw kai hae zaehaih net tang tih? To tiah zaehaih na net nahaeloe, lok apae ai ah kang hngai duem moe, ka duek halat han boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmuen hnetto khue ni kang hnik; nang paek nahaeloe na hmaa hoiah kang hawk ving mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai khae hoi na ban to azuk ving ah, na zitthohhaih hoiah na pazih hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />To pacoengah na kawk ah, kang pathim han; to tih ai boeh loe kai ka thuih hmaloe han, to pacoengah nang mah pathim ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka sakpazaehaih hoi zaehaih nazetto maw oh? Ka sakpazaehaih hoi ka zaehaih to na patuek ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tipongah mikhmai na hawk moe, na misa ah nang suek loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Takhi mah hmuh ih thingqam to na zit maw? Kangqo thingqam to na patom han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kakhaa parai ka zaehaih to na pakuem moe, thendoeng nathuem ah ka sak ih zaehaih atho to vaihi kai han nang tongsak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka khok ah thlong nang thuk moe, ka caehhaih loklamnawk boih to na khet; ka cawh ih khokkong doeh na parui boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />To tiah raihaih tongh kami loe, kaqong hmuen baktih, karaa mah caak ih laihaw kaprawn baktiah, thazok moe, anghmat zuep boeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nongpata mah tapen ih kami loe nawnetta hing nathung raihaih hoiah koi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anih loe apawk baktiah ampha tahang moe, azaem roep; tahlip baktiah cawnh, cak poe ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To baktih hmuen pongah mik na padai moe, lokcaekhaih hmaa ah nang caeh haih han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi mah maw kaciim ai thung hoiah kaciim hmuen to sin thai tih? Mi mah doeh sin thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kami ih aninawk to kroek moe, khrah nazetto maw oh pae vop, tiah na panoek pae pongah, anih mah poeng thai han ai ah ramri to na sak pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toksak han tlai ih kami baktiah, angmah ih aninawk boeng khoek to, angmah koeh ah oh hanah, anih to angqoi taak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thing loe pakhruk cadoeh, tadok tacawt let ueloe, tanghang kangtha tacawt let tih, tiah oep han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Long thung ih tangzuun loe mitong boeh pongah, long ah akung dueh cadoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tui hmui hoiah tadok let ueloe, thingkung kanawk baktiah tanghang tacawt let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toe kami loe duek moe, qong ving; ue, a hinghaih boeng pacoengah loe naa ah maw om vop tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipui tui loe anghmat moe, vacong tui doeh kaang king baktih toengah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kami loe angsong moe, angthawk let ai boeh; vannawk anghmaa ai karoek to anglawt mak ai, a iihhaih ahmuen hoi angthawk mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw taprong thungah na hawk ah, palung na phuihaih dip ai karoek to, tamquta hoi na hawk ah! Kai pahnet han ai ah, ka oh han ih atue to na khaek pae ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kami loe duek pacoengah hing let tih maw? Karai toksakhaih aninawk loe sawk parai cadoeh, kam khraihaih atue pha ai karoek to ka zing han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang kawk naah, kang pathim pae han; na ban hoi sak ih hmuen to na koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaihi loe ka khok tangkannawk to na kroek moe, ka zaehaih to na khen ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka sakpazaehaih loe pasah thungah catui ka daeng boeh moe, ka zaehaih nang kraeng pae hmoek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tanim thaih mae loe anghmat boeh moe, lungsong doeh a ohhaih ahmuen hoiah angthuih ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuinawk mah thlung to maawtsak moe, tui tha mah long to takhawh baktih toengah, kami oephaih to nam rosak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kami to na pazawk poe, anih loe anghmat ving boeh; anih ih mikhmai to nam khraisak moe, kalah bangah na patoeh ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A capanawk mah pakoehhaih hnu o cadoeh, anih mah panoek ai boeh; nihcae atlim ah krah o cadoeh, anih mah panoek pae ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toe anih ih ngan to naa ueloe, a hinghaih palungsae tih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Taman acaeng Eliphaz mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />palungha kami loe takhi hoi kanghmong lokthuih han oh maw? A zok to ni angyae bang ih takhi hoi koisak han oh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tidoeh avang ai lok, to tih ai boeh loe atho om ai lok thuih han oh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ue, nang loe Sithaw zithaih to na pahnawt sut boeh moe, Sithaw khae lawkthuihaih doeh na pakaa khoep boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pakha mah zaehaih to thuih moe, aling thaih kami ih lok to na patoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai mah zaehaih kang net ai, na pakha mah ni ang net; ue, na palai mah na sethaih to thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang loe tapen tangsuek kami ah maw na oh? Maenawk sah ai naah sak ah na oh boeh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sithaw khae hoi ih tamqu lok to na thaih vai maw? Palunghahaih tawn kami loe nang khue maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka panoek o ai ih hmuen, timaw na panoek? Ka thaih o kop ai ih hmuen, timaw na thai kop?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nam pa pongah saning coeh, sampok kaminawk kaicae khaeah oh vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sithaw pathloephaih lok to na khawt ai vop maw? Hawk ih hmuen na suek vop maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tipongah palung koehhaih to na paroi moe, miktamai hoiah mik na padai loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To tiah na oh pongah na ai maw Sithaw koeh ai ih hmuen to na sak moe, na pakha thung hoiah lok na tacawtsak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kami loe timaw, anih loe ciim thai tih maw? Nongpata mah tapen ih kami loe toeng thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw loe angmah ih kaciim kaminawk mataeng doeh oep ai; ue, a hmaa ah loe vannawk doeh ciim ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe zaehaih tui baktih kanae, panuet thok kami cae loe kawkruk maw amhnong tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tahngai ah, kang thuih han vop; ka hnuk ih hmuen to kang thuih han vop;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />palungha kaminawk loe, ampanawk khae hoi hak ih hmuennawk to angphat ai ah thuih o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nihcae acaeng han khue ni prae to paek, nihcae salakah acaeng kalah mi doeh om o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kasae kami loe a hing thung patangkhang, pacaekthlaek thaih kami loe a hing thung karai tong han ih saningnawk to panoek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih ih naa loe zithaih lok hoiah koi; khosak hoih nathuem ah, a nuiah amrohaih to phak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih loe vinghaih thung hoi loih hanah oephaih tawn ai; sumsen ni a zing sut boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih loe amhet rumram moe, caaknaek to pakrong; a nuiah pha han koi vinghaih ani loe zoi boeh, tiah anih mah panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Raihaih hoi palungboenghaih mah anih to tasoehsak moe, siangpahrang mah misatuk han amsakcoek baktih toengah, raihaih hoi palungboenghaih mah anih to pazawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anih mah Sithaw to ban payangh thuih moe, Thacak Sithaw ih lok aek hanah tha pathok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kathah parai misa angvaenghaih aphawnawk to angkhuk moe, Sithaw to a hmang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />anih ih mikhmai loe thawk hruk moe, a kaeng ih ngan doeh tasa bangah tacawt dok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anih loe kamro tangcae vangpuinawk, mi mah doeh om haih ai ih, kamtimh tom imnawk ah ni khosak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anih loe angraeng thai mak ai, anih angraenghaih doeh cak mak ai; long nui khosak naah a tawnh ih hmuennawk doeh pung mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anih loe vinghaih thung hoi loih thai mak ai; anih ih tanghangnawk loe hmai mah kang ueloe, Sithaw pakha thung ih takhi mah hmut phaeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Avang ai hmuen oephaih hoiah angmah hoi angmah to angling hmah nasoe, to tih ai nahaeloe avang ai atho to ni anih mah hnu tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anih loe atue pha ai naah azaem ueloe, tanghang doeh tacawt mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anih loe hmin ai naah pakhrik ving ih misurthaih baktih, apawk kangmuen olive thingkung baktiah ni om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sithaw tidoeh sah ai kaminawk loe azaem o tih; bokhaih tangqum koeh kaminawk ih kahni im loe hmai mah kang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nihcae loe raihaih to zok ah pomh o moe, tidoeh avang ai caa to tapen o; nihcae ih zok loe alinghaih to ni pomh o, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />to baktih loknawk ka thaih pop parai boeh; pathloephaih lok nang thuih o, toe poek amrosakkung ah ni na oh o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Avang ai loknawk to boeng thai ai boeh maw? Tipongah maw lok pathim hanah misa na hoih o?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kang doethaih ahmuen ah na oh o nahaeloe, na thuih o ih baktiah ka thuih thai toeng; lok hoi kang zoeh o thaih moe, lu kang haek o thuih thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe ka pahni hoi tacawt pathloephaih lok mah nangcae poek mongsak hanah, thapaekhaih lok ni kang thuih o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lok ka thuih cadoeh, ka nathaih hoihkhang ai; lokthui ai ah ka pauep cadoeh, hoih kuehaih om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe Anih mah kai angphosak boeh; ka imthung takoh boih nam rosak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka nganhin loe angcu boih boeh, nganhin angcu loe kai hnukung ah oh; kai loe ka zaek keng boeh, ka nganhin zaekhaih loe kai hnukung ah oh hanah mikhmai kangtong ah angdoet tahang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sithaw palungbethaih mah kai hae angsih pet pet moe, ang pacaekthlaek; haa ang kaek thuih; ka misa mah miktamai hoiah ang khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae mah pakha ang angh o thuih; nihcae loe nawnto amkhueng o moe, khet patoekhaih hoiah tangbaeng ah ang tabaeng o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih mah Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk ban ah ang paek moe, kahoih ai kaminawk ban ah ang vah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamongah ka oh naah, anih mah kai amrosak; tahnong ah ang patawnh moe, apet pat hanah ang thuek pacoengah, kah han patoep ih ahmuen maeto baktiah ang suek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kalii kaat kop anih ih kaminawk mah kai ang takui o khoep moe, tahmenhaih tawn ai ah kaeng ah ang thun o; kai ih ahmuet tui to long ah ang kraih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anih mah ahmaa maeto pacoeng maeto angsihsak moe, misatuh kami baktiah tha hoiah ang hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nganhin nuiah kazii to ka huih moe, kaimah ih taki to maiphu thungah ka phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka qah loiah ka mikhmai hae amro moe, ka miklakoek nuiah duekhaih to oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />toe ka ban ah sethaih hmuen tidoeh om ai; lawk ka thuihaih loe ciim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw long, kai ih athii hae kraeng hmah; ka hanghaih lok loe natuek naah doeh anghak hmah nasoe!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khenah, vaihi kai hnukung van ah oh, kai angdoe haih kami doeh hmuensang ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kam puinawk mah ang pahnui o thuih, kai loe mikkhraetui hoiah ni Sithaw hmaa ah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kami maeto mah ampui han tahmenhaih hnik pae baktih toengah, kami maeto mah Sithaw khaeah tahmenhaih na hni pae nahaeloe ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saning akra ai ah, amlaem let han ai ih loklam to ka pazui han boeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hinghaih amro boeh moe, kai ih aninawk doeh laemh boeh; taprong mah ang zing kong boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nihcae mah kai ang pahnui o thuih na ai maw? Ang pahrue o haih to ka mik mah hnuk toepsoep na ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaihi kai han kacak lokkamhaih to na paek ah, mi hoiah maw ban kang sinh hoi han?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nihcae panoekhaih palung mik na maengsak boeh; to pongah nihcae to pakoeh hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ampui aling kami loe, a caanawk mikmaeng pae tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kaminawk mah kasae thuih hanah anih mah ang suek, kai loe minawk mah mikhmai ah tamtui pathoih ih kami ah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Palungset loiah ka mik amtueng ai boeh, ka takpum boih tahlip baktiah ni oh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toenghaih hoi khosah kaminawk loe hae hmuen pongah dawnrai o tih, zaehaih tawn ai kaminawk loe angsah cop kaminawk nuiah palungphui o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toe katoeng kami loe a caehhaih loklam ah caeh poe ueloe, ban ciim kami loe thacak aep aep tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangcae thungah palungha kami maeto doeh ka hnu ai pongah, vaihi amlaem o boih lai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai ih aninawk loe laemh boeh moe, ka sak atimhaih hoi palung thungah ka poek ih hmuen doeh amro ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hae kaminawk mah aqum to khodai ah paqoi o moe, khoving naah khodai loe zoi boeh, tiah thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Taprong loe kai ih im ni, tiah ka zing; vinghaih thungah iihhaih kahni to ka baih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amrohaih khaeah, Nang loe kam pa ni, tiah ka naa; sadong khaeah, Nang loe kam no hoi ka tanu ah na oh, tiah ka naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihi ka oephaih naa ah maw oh? Mi mah maw ka oephaih to hnu tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nihcae loe kai hoi nawnto maiphu thungah anghak hanah, taprong khongkha thungah caeh o tathuk tih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Shud acaeng Bildad mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hae tiah na thuih ih loknawk hae natuek naah maw boeng tih? Kahoih ah pakuem ah, lok ka thuih o han vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tipongah kaicae hae moisan baktih, kamthu baktiah na poek loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Palungphui moe, angmah hoi angmah ngan angsik, nang pongah, long hae anghuen tih maw? Thlung loe a ohhaih ahmuen hoiah angthui tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ue, kasae kami ih hmaithaw loe dueh tih, kangqong anih ih hmai doeh aang mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih kahni im ih hmai to aang han ai ah, anih ih hmaithawk to paduek pae ving tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anih thacakhaih khok tangkannawk loe tamcaek tih; angmah koeh ah khokhanhaih mah anih to amtimsak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih ih khok loe palok pongah aman moe, thaang to cawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih ih khok thaang pongah aman moe, loih thai ai ah asawt khing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih hanah long thungah qumqaih pae moe, a caehhaih loklam ah thaang to patung pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zitthok hmuen mah caeh nakung kruekah anih to tasoehsak; a khok takan kruek anih hnukah bang pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih loe zok amthlam pongah thazok, amrohaih mah anih to zing coek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To amrohaih mah a nganhin ahap to caak pae, calu duekhaih mah a thacakhaih to paaeh pae ving tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anih to kamongah ohhaih kahni imthung hoiah pathok ueloe, zitthok siangpahrang hmaa ah caeh haih tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ohhaih ahmuen ah anih ih hmuen tidoeh anghmat mak ai; a ohhaih ahmuen ah kaat hmai to haeh pae tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih ih tangzuunnawk loe long thungah zaek o moe, a nui ih tanghangnawk doeh angqo o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih panoekhaih loe long ah anghmat moe, prae thungah ahmin om ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aanghaih thung hoiah vinghaih thungah anih to haek boeh moe, long nui hoiah haek ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih loe angmah ih kaminawk salakah capa tawn ai, a caanawk ih caa patoeng doeh tawn mak ai, a imthung takoh ah mi doeh anghmat mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni angyae bang ih kaminawk loe tasoeh o baktih toengah, niduem bangah kaom kaminawk doeh anih kawng pongah dawnrai o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kasae kami khosakhaih loe to tiah oh, Sithaw panoek ai kami ohhaih ahmuen doeh to tiah oh tangtang, tiah pathim pae.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pacoengah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kai poek nang patang o sak, nasetto maw lok hoiah nang pacaekthlaek o han vop?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vai hato nang zoeh o boeh; azathaih tawn ai ah panoek vai ai ih kami baktiah nang zoeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakpazaehaih ka tawnh cadoeh, ka sakpazaehaih loe kaimah nuiah ni krak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangcae loe kai ni nam oek o thuih, a sak ih zaehaih pongah ni azathaih hoiah oh, tiah nang naa o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />toe kai loe Sithaw mah ni amtimsak moe, anih ih thaang pongah ka manh, tito panoek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khenah, ka sakpazaehaih thung hoiah ka hang; mi mah doeh tahngai ai; tha hoi ka hangh, toe toenghaih hoiah lokcaek kami om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih mah ka poeng thaih han ai ah ka caehhaih loklam to pakaa khoep, anih mah ka caehhaih loklam ah vinghaih to suek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lensawkhaih to anih mah ang khringh pae moe, ka lu nui ih lumuek to ang lak pae ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih mah ahmuen kruek hoi ang boh pongah, kam ro boeh; anih mah ka oephaih to thing baktiah ang phongh pae ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih ih palung kabae to kai khaeah ang palai moe, kai hae a misa ah ang poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih ih misatuh kaminawk loe, kai tuk hanah nawnto angzoh o moe, kai ih kahni im taeng boih ah atai o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kam nawkamyanawk to kai khae hoi kangthla ah a ohsak moe, kam puinawk doeh panoek vai ai ih kami baktiah ni oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka canawknawk mah ang pahnawt o moe, kam puinawk mah ang pahnet o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka tamna nongpatanawk hoi ka imthung takohnawk mah angvin baktih, prae kalah kami baktiah ang khet o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tamna to ka kawk naah, na pathim ai; tahmenhaih ka hnik cadoeh, na pathim ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kang hahhaih takhi loe ka zu koeh koiah om ai, ka caanawk hanah panuet thok hmuen ah oh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ue, nawktanawk mah ang patoek o, kang thawk tahang naah, ang pahnui o thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kam puinawk mah ang panuet o moe, ka palung ih kaminawk doeh ka misa ah angcoeng o ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka huh loe nganhin hoi angbet rap boeh moe, ka haa doeh angkhringh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw kam puinawk, na tahmen oh, na tahmen oh; Sithaw mah ni ang boh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tipongah Sithaw pacaekthlaek baktiah kai nang pacaekthlaek o loe? Kai ih angan hoiah zok nam hah o ai vop maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw, ka loknawk hae pakuem o nasoe loe, nihcae mah cabu ah pathok o nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sum cacung hoiah tarik o nasoe loe, thlung nuiah dungzan ah tarik o poe nasoe!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kai akrangkung loe hing, tiah ka panoek; anih loe hnukkhuem atue boeng naah long ah angdoe tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ka nganhin amro moe, hae takpum hae amro ving cadoeh, ka taksa hoiah Sithaw to ka hnu vop tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />anih to ka hnu tih; minawk mah hnuk ih na ai, kaimah roe mik hoiah ka hnu tih; ka palungthin mah zing kong boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangcae mah, anih hae kawbangmaw pacaekthlaek han, anih zae nethaih kawbangmaw hnuk thai han? tiah na thuih o,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />sumsen to na zit o han oh, Sithaw palungphuihaih mah sumsen hoi danpaekhaih to tacawtsak, lokcaekhaih atue oh, tiah panoek oh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Naamath acaeng Zophar mah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka pathim hanah, ka palung thungah toksak pongah, karangah ka thuih han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai kasae na thuihaih hoi zoehhaih lok to ka thaih boeh, to pongah pathim han angaih, tiah palung thung hoi ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Long ah kami oh tangsuekhaih atue, canghnii atue hoi kaom hae baktih hmuen hae na panoek ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kasae kami khosak hoihaih loe sawk ai, Sithaw tidoeh sah ai kami anghoehaih doeh nawnetta ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lensawkhaih mah van to phak moe, a lu mah tamai angtok cadoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />anih loe angmah ih aek baktiah ni amro poe tih, anih hnu kaminawk mah, Anih loe naa ah maw oh ving boeh? tiah thui o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih loe amang baktiah azawk ving tih, hnu mak ai boeh; ue, khoving amang ah hnuk ih hmuen baktiah anghmaa ving tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih hnu mik mah anih to hnu let mak ai boeh; a ohhaih ahmuen mah doeh anih to khen mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A caanawk loe amtang kaminawk khaeah tahmenhaih hni o ueloe, a tawnh o ih hmuenmae to a ban hoiah paek pathok o let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih ih huhongnawk loe thendoeng thacak nathuem ih zaehaih hoiah koi cadoeh, angmah hoi nawnto maiphu thungah angsong tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sethaih loe anih ih pakha ah luep, anih mah angmah ih palai tlim ah hawk moe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />paawt pongah pahnawt sut han koeh ai, angmah ih pakha thungah paumh hmoek cadoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a caak ih buh zok thungah phak naah thaw ueloe, pahui sae ih kasoetui ah angcoeng pae tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih mah paaeh ih angraenghaihnawk to pathaak let ueloe, Sithaw mah anih ih zok thung hoiah la let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih loe pahui sae ih kasoetui to pazop ueloe, pahui sae mah anih to patuk maat tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih loe kalong tuipui, khoitui hoi kamkhawk tahnutui longhaih tui to hnu mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A toksakhaih atho to caa mak ai, minawk hanah paek let tih; to tiah a paek let pongah anih loe anghoehaih tawn mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih mah kamtang kaminawk to pacaekthlaek moe, tiah doeh sah ai; angmah sak ai ih imnawk to a lomh pae pongah to tiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih loe koehhaih boep thai ai; a koeh ih hmuen mah anih pahlong thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih mah caak han ih buh tidoeh om mak ai boeh; a tawnh ih angraenghaih hmuen doeh cak poe mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmuenmae angraeng nathuem ah amtang ueloe, a nuiah raihaih congca to pha tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih zok amhah han oh naah, Sithaw mah palungphuihaih to a nuiah phasak ueloe, buhcaak nathuem ah palungphuihaih khotui baktiah angzo tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih loe sum hoi sak ih maiphaw maica thung hoiah loih; toe sumkamling palaa mah anih to kaat tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anih loe a takpum thung hoi tacawt, palaa to aphongh; ue, anih ih ahmuet thung hoiah rong kampha sumsen to tacawt; a nuiah zithaih to phak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />anih tamquta hoi ohhaih ahmuen ah khovinghaih to suek pae; anih loe kami mah hmuh ai ih hmai mah kang tih; a ohhaih kahni im ah kaom hmuennawk boih to kangh pae tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Van mah anih sakpazaehaih amtuengsak tih, long mah doeh anih han misa angthawk thui tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A im ih hmuenmaenawk to anghmaa tih, Angraeng palungphuihaih niah loe anih khosak hoihaih to tui baktiah long tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sithaw mah to baktih tangqum to kasae kaminawk hanah paek, Sitawh mah to baktih qawktoep hanah anih to suek, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka lok hae kahoih ah tahngai ah; nang pathloephaih lok loe hae tiah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tahngai ah, lok ka thuih han vop; koeh boeh loe ka thuih pacoengah, na pahnui thui ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai loe kami maw laisaep thuih? To tiah om nahaeloe, palung duem ai ah om tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kai hae na khen ah loe, dawnrai ah; pakha to ban hoi tamuep ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hae kawng hae ka poek naah ka zit moe; ka takpum boih tasoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tipongah kasae kaminawk loe hinglung sawk o, mitong khoek to ngantui o moe, angraeng o pacoengah, thacak o loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih ih caanawk loe angmah taengah khosak o moe, angmah ih acaengnawk doeh a mikhnuk ah qoeng o tahang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A imnawk doeh misa zithaih om ai, Sithaw danpaekhaih thingboeng doeh nihcae nuiah krah ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae ih maitaw tae loe apet ai ah apaa cuk o moe, kapomh maitaw doeh acaa zuun vai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nihcae ih caanawk loe tuu baktiah caeh o moe, hnawh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cingceng to boh o, katoeng kruek hoiah laa a sak o moe, tamoi lok hoiah anghoe o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nihcae loe taprong ah laem o ai karoek to, hmuenmae angraenghaih hoiah khosak o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nihcae loe Sithaw khaeah, Na caeh taak ah, Na loklam panoek han ka koeh o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thacak Sithaw loe kawbangmaw oh moe, a tok ka sak pae o han loe? Anih khaeah lawk ka thuih o nahaeloe, tih atho maw om tih, tiah a thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khenah, nihcae angraenghaih loe angmacae ban ah om poe ai; kazae kaminawk ih poekhaih to angqoi taak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sithaw mah kasae kaminawk ih hmaithaw to paduek pae, anih palungphui pongah nihcae to amrosak moe, nihcae nuiah vai nazetto maw raihaih to phaksak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nihcae loe takhi mah hmuh ih anghnoeng baktiah oh o moe, takhi sae mah hmuh ih tavai baktiah ni oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangcae mah loe, zaehaih sah kaminawk zuengah a caanawk to Sithaw mah danpaek tih, tiah na thuih o; toe kaimah loe a sak pazaehaih panoek thai hanah, Sithaw mah zaehaih sah kami angmah roe to danpaek nasoe, tiah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Angmah amrohaih to a mik hoi roe hnu nasoe loe, Thacak Sithaw palungphuihaih to nae nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih han paek ih ani hoi akhrah akoep naah loe, anih mah a caeh taak ih a caanawk hanah timaw sah pae thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi mah maw hmuensang ah kaom kaminawk lokcaekkung Sithaw to patuk thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kami maeto loe tha oh li, misa monghaih hoiah khosak moe, nawm li nathuem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A takpum kahoih ah qoeng tahang li moe, ahuhnawk tangkhring hoiah koi li nathuem ah duek ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kalah kami maeto bae loe khosak nawmhaih tong vai ai, a hinghaih patangkhang pongah duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nihnik loe maiphu thungah angsong hoi moe, sadong mah khuk khoep boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khenah, ka nuiah sak han na pacaeng ih kahoih ai hmuen to ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang mah, angraeng ih im naa ah maw oh, kasae kaminawk ih im naa ah maw oh? tiah na thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kholong caeh kaminawk to lok na dueng o vai ai maw? A sak o ih angmathaih to na panoek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kahoih ai kami loe amrohaih ani hanah pahoe boeh, palungphuihaih ani hanah suek boeh pongah, anih loe vaihi loih tih boeh, tiah na poek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sak ih kahoih ai hmuen to mi mah maw taphong pae tih? A sak ih zaehaih baktih toengah mi mah maw pathok tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Toe anih loe taprong ah phak naah doeh, tangprong toepkung to suem pae o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azawn ih long loe anih hanah luep, kami boih anih hnukah patom o ueloe, anih hmaa ah kroek laek ai kaminawk caeh o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe tih han ih azom pui ah kaom lok hoiah nang pathloep o loe? Nang pathimhaih lok ah tangtang to om ai, amsawnlok cing ni oh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Teman acaeng Eliphaz mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />palungha kami loe angmah han ih ni atho oh, kami loe Sithaw han amekhaih oh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na toenghaih mah Thacak Sithaw anghoesak tih maw? Coek koi om ai tuinuen hoihaih rang hoiah anih han tih amekhaih maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sithaw ka zit pongah anih mah ang thuitaek, tiah na poek maw? Anih loe lokcaekhaih ahmuen ah nang hoi nawnto caeh tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na zaehaih loe paroeai len, na zaehaih loe kroek laek ai pop pongah na ai maw hae tiah na oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang loe nam nawkamyanawk ih hmuenmae to na lak pae, nihcae ih khukbuen to na khringh pae moe, bangkrai ah na suek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Angpho kami tuinaek hanah na paek ai, zok amthlam kami doeh buh na pacah ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thacak kami loe long to a tawnh; khingya koi kaom kami loe to ah khosak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toe lamhmainawk to bangkrai ah na patoeh ving moe, ampa tawn ai kaminawk ih ban to nang khaehsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To pongah ni nang loe thaangnawk mah ang takui o khoep moe, zithaih mah raihaih ang paek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe na hnu thai ai ih, vinghaih mah raihaih ang paek moe, paroeai pop tuinawk mah ang uem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sithaw loe kasang van ah na ai maw oh? Van ih cakaehnawk loe nasetto maw sang o, tiah khen ah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe nang mah loe, Sithaw mah kawbangmaw panoek tih? Anih loe kathah tamai kamnum thung hoiah lokcaek thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kathah parai tamai mah anih to khuk khoep pongah, anih mah hnu mak ai; anih loe van amhaehaih loklam ranui ah ni amkaeh, tiah na thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kasae kaminawk caehhaih loklam kangquem to na pazui han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nihcae loe atue akoep ai naah amro o moe, nihcae angdoethaih ahmuen doeh tui mah lak pae king.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nihcae mah Sithaw khaeah, Kaicae hae na caeh taak ah; Thacak Sithaw mah kaicae han timaw sah thai tang tih, tiah thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sithaw mah kahoih hmuen hoiah nihcae ih im to koisak; toe kai loe kasae kaminawk ih poekhaih to kang qoi taak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nihcae amrohaih to katoeng kaminawk mah hnuk o naah, anghoe o; zaehaih tawn ai kaminawk mah nihcae to pahnui o thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kaicae ih misanawk loe amro o tangtang boeh, kanghmat nihcae ih hmuennawk doeh hmai mah kangh boih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sithaw khae ang paek o ah loe, anih hoi angdaeh oh; to tiah na sak o nahaeloe nang khaeah khosak hoihaih angzo tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih pakha thung hoi tacawt daan to talawk ah loe, anih ih lok to na palung thungah khrum ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thacak Sithaw khaeah nam laem o nahaeloe, anih mah na raemh let tih; na ohhaih kahni imthung hoiah na sakpazaehaih to takhoe ving nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />sui to maiphu baktih, Ophir ih sui to tuipui ih thlung baktiah na patung tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ue, Thacak Sithaw loe nang ih sui ah om ueloe, atho kana sumkanglung paroeai na tawn tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe Thacak Sithaw pongah anghoehaih na tawn ueloe, Sithaw to na doeng tahang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih khaeah lawk na thuih naah, anih mah na tahngai pae tih; to tiah lokkamhaih to na koepsak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na patoep ih hmuen to angcoeng ueloe, na caehhaih loklam to aang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kaminawk pakhrak tathuk naah, nang loe pakoehhaih ah ka oh, tiah na thui tih; mi tlim ah khosah kami loe Sithaw mah pahlong tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anih mah zaehaih tawn kami to pahlong tih; kaciim na ban hoiah anih to pahlong tih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />vaihni loe kana ka haam; ka nathaih nung parai pongah hang ai ah ka om thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih hnukthaihaih ahmuen to ka panoek nahaeloe, anih anghnuthaih ahmuen ah ka caeh han!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmaa ah kaimah kawng to ka thuih moe, pakha hoiah lok ka thuih han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih mah kawbangmaw na pathim tih, tiah ka panoek, a thuih han ih lok doeh ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thacakhaih hoiah kai hae na hmang tih maw? Na hmang mak ai; anih mah kai ih lok hae tahngai lat tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To ahmuen ah katoeng kami hoi lokthuihaih om tih, kai loe lokcaek kami khae hoiah ka loih poe tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khenah, kai loe hmabangah ka caeh, toe anih loe to ahmuen ah om ai; hnukbangah kang nawn cadoeh, anih to ka panoek thai ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a toksakhaih banqoi bangah ka caeh, toe anih to ka hnu thai ai; bantang bangah kang qoi naah doeh, anih to ka hnu thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toe ka caehhaih loklam to ang panoek pae; anih mah kai ang tanoek pacoengah loe, sui baktiah ka om tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka khok mah a caehhaih khok tangkannawk to pazui, kam khraeng taak ai, anih ih loklam to ka pazui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pahni hoi paek ih lok to ka caeh taak ai; ni thokkruek kangaih caaknaek pongah doeh anih mah thuih ih loknawk to ni ka palung kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe poekhaih maeto ah kaom, Sithaw to mi mah maw pakhrai thai tih? Anih loe a koehhaih baktiah ni sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anih loe kai han suek ih hmuen to a sak; anih loe to baktih poekhaih paroeai tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />To pongah a hmaa ah loe zithaih hoiah ni ka oh; to baktih hmuen to ka poek naah, anih to ka zit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sithaw mah palungthin ang naemsak moe, Thacak Angraeng mah zithaih to ang paek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />toe kai hae khoving hmaa ah va sut ai, ka hmaa ih khoving thung hoiah doeh paka ai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tipongah Thacak Sithaw mah lokcaekhaih atue to khaek ai loe? Anih panoek kaminawk mah anih lokcaekhaih ani to panoek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thoemto kaminawk loe ramri to tahruet o; minawk ih tuunawk to a lomh pae o moe, angmacae hanah pacah o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naqahnawk ih laa hrang to huih pae o ving moe, lamhmai ih maitaw tae to paawng ih hmuen baktiah lak pae o ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Caaknaek tawn ai kaminawk to loklam amkhraeng o sak, long ah kaom amtang kaminawk loe nawnto anghawk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khenah, amtang kaminawk loe toksak hanah taw ih laa hrangnawk baktiah a caeh o; khawnthaw ah caeh o moe, angmacae hoi a caanawk hanah taw ah caaknaek pakrong o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nihcae loe lawk ah cang aah o moe, kahoih ai kaminawk ih misur thaih to pakhrik pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nihcae loe khukbuen tawn o ai, bangkrai ah iih o; angqai naah angkhuk hanah tawn o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mae ih khotui mah nihcae to bawh moe, abuephaih tawn o ai pongah, lungsong to takop o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amno ih tahnutui kanae ampa tawn ai nawkta to a lak pae o, amtang kaminawk to hmuenmae paawng o sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae to khukbuen tawn ai bangkrai ah caeh o sak moe, zok amthlam kami ih cangqui to lomh pae o ving;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nihcae loe lawk ah olive tui pasawh o, misurtui doeh pasawh o; toe tui anghaehhaih hoiah patangkhang o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vangpui thung hoiah kaminawk hanghaih lok to tacawt, ahmaa kacaa kaminawk loe tahmen hnikhaih hoiah hangh o; toe nihcae tahmen hnikhaih to Sithaw mah tidoeh sah pae ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nihcae loe aanghaih lokaek kaminawk ah oh o; nihcae loe aanghaih loklam to panoek o ai, to loklam doeh pazui o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kami humnawk loe khawnthaw ah angthawk o moe, caaknaek tawn ai kami hoi amtang kaminawk to hum o pacoengah, aqum ah hmuenmae to paquk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zu sava laep ah zaehaih sak koeh kami loe khoving to a zing kongh, a mikhmai to khuk khoep, mi mah doeh na hnu mak ai, tiah a poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nihcae loe khoving ah minawk ih im to muk o, khodai ah loe imthung ah anghawk o; aanghaih to panoek o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khoving loe nihcae ih ampui ah oh pongah, khodai loe nihcae han duekhaih tahlip ah oh pae lat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To baktih kahoih ai kaminawk loe tui nui ih kakhoem tui apoep baktiah ni oh o; long tahamsethaih loe nihcae ih taham ah oh; to pongah misur takha caehhaih lam taengah mi doeh caeh ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni kabae hoi khokhaahaih mah dantui amkawsak baktih toengah, taprong mah kazae kaminawk to amrosak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zok mah anih to pahnet ueloe, sadong mah anih to rawkcak kahoih ah caa tih; anih to mi mah doeh panoek mak ai boeh; sethaih loe thing baktiah hmawn tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kahoih ai kami loe caa kaak nongpata to pakrong, lamhmai tahmenhaih doeh tawn ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thacak kami to Sithaw mah a thacakhaih hoiah amrosak; nihcae thacak naah, kaminawk khosak monghaih tawn o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sithaw mah anih to kamongah omsak doeh om tih; toe Angraeng mah a caehhaih loklam to khet parui pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nawnetta thungah ni kasang ah pakoeh o, to pacoengah loe anghmat o boih; atlim ah zaeh tathuk moe, minawk kalah baktiah hinghaih to lak pae pacoengah, cangqui baktiah khaeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vaihi hae tiah om ai nahaeloe, ka thuih ih lok loe amsawn ni, avanghaih tidoeh om ai, tiah mi mah maw amtuengsak thai tih? tiah a thuih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Shud acaeng Bildad mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sithaw loe ukhaih, khingyahaih hoiah koi; anih ohhaih hmuensang ah loe monghaih to ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi mah maw anih ih misatuh kaminawk to kroek thai tih? Anih aanghaih mah toeh ai ih mi maw kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To tiah om nahaeloe kami loe kawbangmaw Sithaw hmaa ah toeng thai ueloe, kawbangmaw nongpata mah tapen ih kami loe ciim thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khenah, khrah doeh aang ai; cakaehnawk mataeng doeh anih hmaa ah ciim o ai nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />alungh ah kaom kami, sadong ah kaom, kami capa cae loe, kawkruk maw tidoeh athum ai ah om tih? tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kawbangmaw thacak ai kami to na bomh, bantha cak ai kami to na pahlong?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawbangmaw palungha ai kami khaeah lok na thuih pae? Kawbangmaw kahoih poekhaih to paroeai kaminawk khaeah nam tuengsak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hae lok hae mi han ih maw na thuih? Nang khae hoi angzo muithla loe mi ih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuinawk tlim ah kaom kadueh kaminawk, tui thungah kaom hmuennawk loe tasoeh takuenhaih hoiah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hell loe Sithaw hmaa ah bangkrai ah ni oh, amrohaih loe kraenghaih akhuem om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anih mah aluek bang ih van to tidoeh kaom ai ahmuen nuiah payuengh moe, tidoeh kaom ai ahmuen nuiah long to a bangh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kathah tamai nuiah tuinawk to a suek; toe tui kazit mah tamai to tapoksak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih mah angmah ih angraeng tangkhang to khuk moe, angmah ih tamai to a nuiah taboksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tui nuiah kawk parai ramri to a sak moe, aanghaih hoi vinghaih salakah a suek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih mah thuitaek naah, van ih tungnawk to anghuenh moe, dawnraihaih hoiah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thacakhaih hoiah tuipui to tapraek moe, palunghahaih hoiah amoekhaih to koihsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Angmah ih Muithla hoiah van to krang kahoih ah pathoep moe, a ban hoiah kasae pahui to sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khenah, hae hmuennawk loe a sak ih hmuen aqai ah ni oh o vop; aicae mah anih ih lok zetta ni a thaih o vop; toe a thacakhaih khopazih tuen loe mi mah maw panoek thai tih?
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job mah a thuih ih patahhaih lok to thuih patomh poe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka toenghaih ang lak pae ving; ka hinghaih patangkhangsak, Thacak Sithaw loe hing pongah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka hinghaih takhi ka takpum thungah oh nathung, Sithaw ih takhi ka hnaqong thungah oh nathung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka pahni mah kahoih ai hmuen to thui mak ai, ka palai mah alinghaih lok thui mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang loe na toeng tiah, thuih han ih lok to Sithaw mah pakaa nasoe; ka duek khoek to ka toenghaih ka pahnawt sut mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka toenghaih to kacakah ka patawnh, ka prawt ving mak ai; ka hing thung ka palung mah kai hae kasae thui mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka misanawk loe kasae kami ah om o nasoe loe, kai tuk han angthawk kaminawk loe katoeng ai kami ah om o nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Angsah cop kami loe duek moe, Sithaw mah a hinghaih lak pae ving naah, oephaih timaw tawn vop tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih nuiah raihaih phak naah, Sithaw mah anih qahhaih lok to tahngai pae maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih loe Thacak Sithaw khaeah anghoe thai tih maw? Anih mah Sithaw to kawk khing tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sithaw thacakhaih to kang patuek han; Thacak Sithaw poekhaih thuih hanah kang phat mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khenah, nangmacae mah roe na hnuk o boeh; tipongah kavang ai lok to na thuih o loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sithaw mah kasae kami han paek ih taham, kasae kami mah Thacak Sithaw khae hoi hnuk han koi qawk loe hae tiah oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />anih ih caanawk loe pop o parai cadoeh, sumsen hoi hum han ih ni oh o; anih ih caa patoeng kaminawk doeh caaknaek kakhawt ah tawn o mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kahing kanghmat kaminawk loe duekhaih mah muek tih; a zu lamhmainawk loe qah o thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih mah sumkanglung to maiphu baktiah tapop moe, khukbuennawk to tangphrung long baktiah sah langlacadoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a tawnh ih hmuen to katoeng kami mah ni angkhuk tih, zaehaih tawn ai kami mah phoisa to pazet tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sak ih im doeh bongpaha tabu baktiah om ueloe, misa toephaih im baktiah ni om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmuenmae angraeng kami iih han angsong naah loe, hmuennawk tawn mang let mak ai boeh; anih mah mik padai naah, hmuenmaenawk anghmat o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zitthok hmuen mah anih to tuipui baktiah uem ueloe, khoving ah takhi sae mah hmut boih tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni angyae bang ih takhi mah anih to hmuh moe, anghmat ving; a ohhaih ahmuen hoiah kaham takhi sae mah hmuh ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih loe Sithaw ih ban thung hoiah loih han koeh, toe Sithaw mah tahmenhaih tawn ai ah anih to danpaek tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />To naah kaminawk mah ban tabaeng o thui tih, anih kawng kasae thui o ueloe, a ohhaih ahmuen hoiah haek o ving tih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sumkanglung takaehhaih ahmuen to oh moe, sui tui paciihaih ahmuen doeh oh tangtang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sum loe long thung hoiah takaeh moe, sumkamling loe thlung atui pacii naah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kami mah hmaiim to sin moe, sum tacawthaih ahmuen kathuk, duekhaih tahlip khoving thungah sum to pakrong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kami ohhaih ahmuen hoi kangthla, panoek ai ih ahmuen ah, qui hoiah angbangh moe, long to takaeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Long mah caaknaek to tacawtsak, toe atlim ah loe hmai to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To ah kaom thlungnawk loe Sapphire thlung tacawthaih ahmuen ah oh moe, maiphu doeh sui tacawthaih maiphu ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tavaa mah panoek ai ih, tahmu mah doeh hnu ai ih, loklam to oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />to loklam loe kaipui mah cawh ai moe, hmawsaeng kaipui mah doeh pazui vai ai vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kami mah ban hoiah thlung to pakhoih moe, maenawk to takung khoek to takaeh boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlung to pakhoih moe, athung ah kaom atho kana hmuennawk to a hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kalong tui to pakaa moe, hnuk ai ih hmuennawk to a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toe palunghahaih loe naa ah maw hnu thai tih? Palunghahaih ahmuen loe naa ah maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Palunghahaih atho nazetto maw oh, tito kami mah panoek thai ai; kahing kaminawk ohhaih prae ah doeh hnu thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kathuk tui mah, Kai thungah om ai; tuipui mah doeh kai khaeah om ai, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaciim suitui hoiah palunghahaih to qan thai ai moe, phoisa to noek moe, paek cadoeh, palunghahaih to qan thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ophir ih sui hoiah doeh qan thai ai moe, atho kaom onyx hoi sapphire mah doeh qan thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Palunghahaih loe sui, atho kaom kawbaktih thlung hoiah doeh patah thai ai; kaciim suitui hoiah doeh alaih thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koral hoi pale loe thuih han koi om ai; palunghahaih atho loe thlung kathim pongah doeh atho oh kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ethiopia ih Topaz thlung hoiah patah thai ai moe, kaciim suitui hoiah doeh qan thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe palunghahaih loe naa bang hoiah maw angzoh? Panoekthaihaih ahmuen loe naa ah maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Palunghahaih loe hinghaih katawn hmuennawk boih ih mik hoiah hnu thai ai, van ih tavaanawk mah doeh hnu thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amrohaih hoi duekhaih hnik mah loe, Palunghahaih lok to naa hoi khue ni ka thaih, tiah a thuih hoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sithaw mah khue ni palunghahaih loklam to panoek moe, a ohhaih ahmuen to panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih loe long boenghaih to khet moe, van tlim ih hmuennawk boih to a hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Takhi thacakhaih to a noek moe, tuinawk to a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kho angzohhaih dan hoi khopazih tangphra puekhaih loklam to a sak naah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />palunghahaih to a hnuk moe, amtuengsak; ue, anih mah caksak moe, a sak tanoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anih mah kami khaeah, Khenah, Angraeng zithaih loe, palunghahaih ah oh; kasae caeh taakhaih loe, panoekthaihaih ah oh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job mah a thuih ih patahhaih lok to patomh poe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />aw kai loe kalaem tangcae khrah, Sithaw mah khetzawnhaih ni thuem ih baktiah om let nasoe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka lu nuiah angmah ih hmaithawk to paang moe, anih aanghaih hoiah khoving thungah kam kaeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka qoengh li nathuem ih aninawk baktih, ka im ah Sithaw angkomhaih oh nathuem ih aninawk baktiah om let nasoe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />lensawk Sithaw kai khaeah oh moe, ka caanawk hoi nawnto oh o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />maitaw tahnutui hoiah khok to ka pasaeh, thlung thung hoiah situi to tui baktiah long;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />vangpui khongkha ah ka caeh moe, lampui ah kang hnut,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />thendoengnawk mah kai ang hnuk o naah, anghawk o ving; mitongnawk loe angthawk o moe, angdoet o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Angraengnawk loe lokthui o ai, pakha to ban hoiah tamuep o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toksah angraengnawk doeh lok apae o ai, palai to angsumh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naa mah ka lok thaih naah, kai han tahamhoihaih ang paek; mik mah kai hnuk naah, kai hnukung ah oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tipongah tih nahaeloe amtang kami, amno ampa tawn ai kami, bomkung tawn ai kami hang naah ka bomh pongah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kadueh tom kami mah tahamhoihaih ang paek moe, lamhmai to anghoehaih laasak hanah palung kang hoesak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toenghaih to khukbuen ah kang khuk, ka toenghaih loe kahni baktih, lumuek baktiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mikmaengnawk hanah mik ah ka oh moe, khokkhaem kaminawk hanah khok ah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amtang kaminawk hanah ampa ah ka oh moe, angvinnawk ih lok ka tahngaih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kasae kaminawk ih ano to ka khaeh pae moe, anih mah kaek ih kaminawk to ka pahlong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To pacoengah, ka hinghaih aninawk loe savuet baktiah pop, kai loe kaimah ih im ah ni ka dueh tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai ih tangzun loe tui taengah pha ueloe, aqum puek ka tanghang nuiah dantui angbuem tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka lensawkhaih loe cak poe ueloe, ka ban ih kalii doeh tha om let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kaminawk mah ka lok to tahngaih o, ka thuih ih lok to aek o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lok ka thuih pacoengah, mi doeh lok apae o ai boeh; ka thuih ih lok loe nihcae nuiah tui baktiah ca.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nihcae mah khotui zing o baktih toengah kai to ang zing o, hnukkhuem ih khotui kazing baktiah pakha to kalen ah a angh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nihcae ka pahnui thuih naah, nihcae mah tang o ai; ka mikhmai aanghaih to a hnuk o naah, ka mikhmai aanghaih to anghmaa o sak thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nihcae ih loklam to ka qoih moe, kahoih koek ahmuen ah kang hnut, palungsae kami pathloepkung baktih, misatuh kaminawk salak ih siangpahrang baktiah kang hnut, tiah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe kai pongah saning kanawk kaminawk mah ang pahnui o thuih, nihcae ampanawk loe ka panuet moe, tuutoep uinawk hoi nawnto suek han mataeng doeh ka koeh ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ue, nihcae ban thacakhaih loe kai han tidoeh avanghaih om ai, nihcae thacakhaih loe anghmat boih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nihcae loe zok amthlam o pongah, minawk hoi angkom o ai; kami om ai angqai krang praezaek ah ni amhet o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kapring thungah phrohnawk to a aah o moe, caak hanah imphok kung tangzun to takaeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nihcae loe kaminawk ohhaih ahmuen hoiah haek o moe, (kamqu hangh thuih baktih hangh o thuih;)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tahawt thung ih cathaeng khaw thungah oh o moe, longkhaw thung hoi lungsong khaw thungah a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kapring thungah hrang baktiah hangh o moe, soekhring thungah nawnto amkhueng o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nihcae loe kamthu caa ah oh o, ue, khosak kasae kaminawk ih caa ah oh o moe, prae thung hoi haek ih kaminawk ah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaihi loe nihcae mah laa ang sak o thuih; ue, nihcae mah kasae thuih ih kami ah ka oh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nihcae mah ang panuet o moe, kangthla ah ang oh o taak; ka mikhmai tamtui hoi pathoih hanah tongaah o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sithaw mah kalii hoiah ang kah moe, ang pacaekthlaek pongah, ka hmaa ah angsumhaih tawn o ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka bantang bangah thendoengnawk angthawk o moe, ka khok hae ang cawh o; kai amrohaih loklam to a sak o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka loklam to phraek o moe, kai amtimh hanah azom o; nihcae bomhkung mi doeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nihcae loe kalen pui akhaw thungah kakun tui baktiah, kai amrosak hanah tha hoi kai khaeah ang cawnh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zitthok hmuennawk to ka nuiah phak moe, takhi song baktiah ka hinghaih hnukah patom o; ka tawnh ih hmuenmae loe tamai baktiah anghmat boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaihi ka palungthin koih boeh moe, patangkhanghaih aninawk mah ang naeh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aqum mah ka huh hae thunh moe, thaqui kana ka pauep thai ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nathaih nung parai pongah, kaimah ih khubuen mah zaeng ih baktih toengah, ang zaeng caeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih mah tangnong thungah ang nuih, kai loe maiphu hoi tavai baktiah ni ka oh sut boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka Angraeng Nang khaeah ka qah, toe nang pathim ai; kang doet tahang, toe tiah doeh nang sah ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka nuiah tahmenhaih na tawn ai; thacakhaih na ban hoiah nang pacaekthlaek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kai hae nang toengh tahang moe, takhi to nang thuengsak pongah, ka takpum hae nam rosak ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kahing kaminawk boih hanah na sak pae ih im hoi duekhaih thungah, nang caeh haih tih, tiah ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sithaw mah amrohaih phaksak hanah ban phok naah, nihcae mah tahmenhaih hni o langla cadoeh, atho om ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Raihaih tongh kami to ka qah haih ai maw? Amtang kami palung ka sae haih ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kahoih hmuen ka zing naah, kasae hmuen to angzoh; aanghaih ka zing naah, vinghaih to angzoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kai ih pathin loe bet moe, anghakhaih om ai; patangkhanghaih aninawk loe kai tongh hanah angzoh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Niduem naah palungsethaih hoiah ka oh; kaminawk amkhuenghaih ahmuen ah kang doet moe, ka hang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kai loe pahui puinawk ih nawkamya ah ka oh moe, bukbuhnawk ih ampui ah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka nganhin loe amnum moe, ka huhnawk doeh kabae thuih pa ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kai ih katoeng loe palungsethaih ah angcoeng boeh, kai ih tamoi doeh qahhaih lok ah ni angcoeng ving boeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangla to koehhaih mik hoiah ka khet han ai ah, ka mik hoi lokkamhaih to ka sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe Sithaw mah ranui bang hoiah kawbaktih taham maw paek ueloe, ranui ih Thacak Sithaw mah kawbaktih toep han koi qawk maw paek tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kasae kaminawk hanah amrohaih om ueloe, zaehaih sah kaminawk hanah anghmathaih om mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih mah loe ka caehhaih loklamnawk to panoek moe, ka khok tangkannawk doeh kroek boih na ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amsoem ai ah ka caeh moe, alinghaih bangah ka khok tangkan to rang nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kamsoem coih tahhaih hoiah na tah nasoe loe, coek koi om ai ah kho ka sakhaih to Sithaw mah panoek nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Loklam kam khraeng ving moe, ka palungthin mah ka mik koehhaih hnukah patom moeng maw, to tih ai boeh loe ka ban ah panuet thok hmuen maw akap moeng nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka patit ih thingthai to minawk kalah mah caa nasoe, ue, ka patit ih akungnawk doeh aphong o king nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nongpata maeto mah ka palung hae pacuek moe, ka imtaeng kami ih khongkha ah anih to ka zing nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka zu mah minawk ih cang to daeng pae nasoe loe, minawk mah ka zu to muk o nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hae hmuen loe kalen parai zaehaih ah oh; ue, lokcaekkung mah danpaek han koi zaehaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To zaehaih loe amrosak thaih hmai, ka tawnh ih hmuennawk tangzuun khoek to kangh boih hmai ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tamna nongpa hoi nongpatanawk mah kai laisaep o thuih naah, nihcae to khet ka patoek nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sithaw amtueng naah timaw ka sak moe, lokcaek naah timaw ka pathim han?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih doeh kai sahkung Sithaw mah na ai maw sak? Kaihnik loe sahkung maeto mah na ai maw zok thungah sak hmaek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Caaknaek tawn ai kami hanah caaknaek ka paek ai maw, lamhmai ih mik to kam rosak maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe amno ampa tawn ai kaminawk hanah caaknaek paek ai ah, kaimabueng ah ka caak maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(ka thendoeng nathuem hoi ampa ah angcoeng khoek to caaknaek tawn ai kami to ka pacah, ka tapen tangsuek natuem hoi anih to ka bomh boeh;)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khukbuen tawn ai ah dueh kami hoi khukbuen tawn ai ah kaom amtang kami to ka hnuk moe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kai mah anih to bae um ah tuumui kang khuksak ai pongah, anih mah kai tahamhoihaih paek ai maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />lokcaekhaih im ah kai angdoe haih kami om tih hmang, tiah ka poek pongah, amno ampa tawn ai kami to ka pacaekthlaek nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka ban tampawk hae palaeng hoiah amkhraeng ving nasoe loe, ka palaeng huh doeh angkhaek lawt nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sithaw khae hoi ih amrohaih to ka zit, a Lensawkhaih to ka zit pongah to baktih hmuen to ka sah ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sui to kang oep haih maw, to tih ai boeh loe kaciim suitui khaeah, Nang loe ka buephaih ah na oh, tiah ka thuih moeng maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />hmuenmae paroeai ka tawnh moe, ka ban mah hmuenmae paroeai hak thaih pongah kam oek moeng maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ni aengh to ka khet moe, a aanghaih hoiah kacaeh khrah to ka khet naah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tamquta hoi anghoehaih ka tawnh moe, ka pakha mah ka ban hae mok cadoeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />lokcaek koi kaom zaehaih ah ni oh, ranui koekah kaom Sithaw angphat taak baktiah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kai hnuma kami amro naah, kang hoe moe, anih raihaih tongh naah, kam oek vai maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a hinghaih tangoeng moe, zaehaih sak hanah pakha ka aang mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka imthung ah kaom kaminawk mah, zok kamhah ah Job ih moi caa o vai ai, tiah thui o mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Angvinnawk loklam ah iih o han ai ah, kholong caeh kaminawk hanah khongkha to ka paongh pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Adam baktiah ka zaehaih ka hawk ai, ka zaehaih palung thungah ka hawk vai ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />pop parai kami to ka zit, to tih ai boeh loe acaeng kaminawk mah pahnui thui haih to ka zit pongah, kang hngai duem moe, tasa bang tacawt ai ah ka oh vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aw kami maeto mah loe ka lok hae tahngai nasoe! Khenah, vaihi koehhaih lok ka thuih han vop; Thacak Sithaw mah na pathim nasoe; ka zaehaih netkung mah ka zaehaih hae ca ah tarik nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />To ca to palaeng ah ka put moe, sui lumuek baktiah kang muek han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka caehhaih khok tangkannawk anih khaeah ka thuih moe, siangpahrang capa baktiah a taengah ka caeh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kai ih long mah kai hae kasae thuih maw, to tih ai boeh loe mikkhraetui hoiah a qah maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />atho paek ai ah anih ih thingthai to ka caak pae moe, laikok tawnkungnawk hinghaih to kam rosak nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />cang zuengah soekhringkung amprawk nasoe loe, barli cang zuengah phroh amprawk lat nasoe, tiah a naa. Job ih lok loe hae ah boeng boeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loe angmah hoi angmah to katoeng kami ah poek pongah, to kami thumtonawk mah Job ih lok to pathim pae o ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />To naah Ram imthung takoh kami ah kaom, Buz acaeng Barakel capa Elihu loe palungphui; angmah hoi angmah Sithaw pong katoeng kue ah poek pongah, Job nuiah palungphui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Job ih lok to pathim o thai ai pongah, angmah ih ampui thumto nuiah doeh palungphui moe, Job doeh zaehaih a net.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elihu loe nihcae pongah saning nawk kue pongah, Job lokthuih boeng ai karoek to a zing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />To kami thumtonawk loe lokthuih han tawn o ai boeh, tiah Elihu mah panoek naah, paroeai palungphui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To pongah Barakel capa Buz acaeng Elihu mah, Kai loe saning ka nawk vop, nangcae loe saning na coeh o boeh; to pongah kang zit o moe, ka poekhaih kang thui o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai mah loe, Saning coeh kami mah lok to thuih moe, saning sawkah khosah kami mah palunghahaih patuk han oh, tiah ka poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toe kami thungah muithla oh; Thacak Sithaw ih takhi mah anih to panoekhaih paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saning coeh kaminawk khue palungha ai, katoeng hmuen loe saning coeh kaminawk khue mah ni panoek tito na ai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To pongah ka lok hae tahngai oh; ka poekhaih kang thuih o toeng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khenah, na thuih o ih loknawk to ka zing; lokthuih han na poek o moe, na thuih o ih lok to kang tahngaih pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ue, nangcae ih lok to ka tahngaih; khenah, mi mah doeh Job na pazawk o ai; a lok to mi mah doeh na pathim o thai ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />to pongah palunghahaih ka hnuk o boeh, tiah thui o moeng hmah; Job pahnaemkung loe, kami na ai, Sithaw ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job mah ka lok hae aek ai, na thuih o ih lok baktiah, anih ih lok to ka pathim mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nihcae loe dawnrai o, lokthuih han tawn o ai pongah lok apae ai ah oh o duem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka zing naah, nihcae lok apae o ai, lok pathim ai ah, oh o duem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />to pongah kaimah han lok ka thuih moe, ka poekhaih doeh kam tuengsak han, tiah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kai thungah kaom muithla mah ang pahruek pongah, thuih han lok zetpui ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khenah, ka zok loe tacawthaih akhaw om ai misurtui baktih, kakoi tom moihin tabu kangtha baktiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngantuihaih ka hnuk hanah, lok ka thuih han; pahni ka angh moe, lok ka pathim han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih mikhmai doeh ka khen mak ai, mi doeh ka pakoeh mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minawk pakoehhaih lok thuih hanah ka panoek ai; to tiah ka thuih nahaeloe, kai sahkung Sithaw mah kai hae amrosak ving tih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toe Job, ka lok hae tahngai ah; ka thuih ih loknawk boih hae tahngai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khenah, vaihi pakha ka angh moe, ka palai mah lokthuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka loknawk loe ka poek toenghaih hoiah ni angzoh; ka palai mah kahoih palunghahaih lok to thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sithaw ih Muithla mah ni kai hae sak moe, Thacak Angraeng ih takhi mah hinghaih ang paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pathim thaih nahaeloe na patim ah, amsakcoek ah loe ka hmaa ah angdoe ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw hmaa ah kai doeh nang baktiah ni ka oh, kai doeh long hoiah ni sak toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khenah, na zit han koi kai khaeah tidoeh om ai; na nuiah kazit ban to ka koeng mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thuih ih lok to ka thaih, na thuih ih loknawk to ka thaih boeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kai loe ka ciim, zae sakhaih ka tawn ai; sakpazaehaih doeh ka tawn ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw mah ka zaehaih pakrong; kai hae a misa ah ang suek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ka khok hae thlong ang thuk pae moe, ka caehhaih loklamnawk boih ang pakaa, tiah na thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khenah, na thuih pazae boeh; lok kang pathim han vop, Sithaw loe kami pongah len kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anih mah ka sak ih hmuen kawng pongah lok pathim ai, tiah na thuih moe, Sithaw to na laisaep thuih loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sithaw mah lok vaito thuih pacoengah, kalah loklam bang hoiah lok a thuih pae let, toe kami mah panoek pae thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kami loe iih angam moe, iihhaih ahmuen ah a iih, qum amang ah hnuksakhaih mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a naa thungah lok to thuih pae moe, thuitaekhaih lok to paek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kami mah sak atimhaih to pahnawt moe, amoekhaih tawn han ai ah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih hinghaih to tangqom thung hoiah Sithaw mah pahlong moe, sumsen hoi duek han ai ah pakaa pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih loe iihhaih ahmuen ah angsong hanah nathaih hoiah kami to thuitaek moe, ahuhnawk boih to natsak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />To naah a hinghaih mah buh to panuet moe, palung mah buhcaak angnaa pae ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih loe zaek kaeng boeh moe, kamtueng vai ai ahuhnawk doeh, amtueng boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ue, a hinghaih mah taprong to pangh tathuk, a hinghaih amrosakkungnawk khaeah phak tom boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toe kaminawk khaeah toenghaih loklam to patuek hanah, van kami sangto thungah, maeto mah Sithaw hoi kami salakah laicaeh ah om nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sithaw mah anih to tahmen ah loe, Tangqom thung caeh han ai ah anih to pahlong ah; anih akranghaih to ka hnuk boeh, tiah thui tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />To naah anih ih ngan loe nawkta ngan baktiah angcoeng let ueloe, thendoeng nathuem ih baktih toengah om let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anih mah Sithaw khaeah lawkthui ueloe, mikhmai hoihaih to hnu tih; anghoehaih hoi Sithaw ih mikhmai to hnu tih; Sithaw mah a toenghaih to kami hanah paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih mah kaminawk hmaa ah, Mi kawbaktih mah doeh ka zae moeng boeh, toenghaih to toeng ai ah ka sak moeng boeh, to hmuen mah kai han avanghaih tidoeh na paek ai, tiah thui nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anih mah tangqom thung hoiah a hinghaih to akrang ueloe, a hinghaih mah aanghaih to hnu tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw mah hae hmuennawk hae kami khaeah sak toepsoep;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />anih hinghaih to tangqom thung hoiah amlaemsak let moe, hinghaih paek aanghaih thungah a caeh haih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw Job, naa to patuengah loe, ka lok hae acoehaih hoiah tahngai ah; anghngai duem ah; lok kang thuih han vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lokthuih na koeh nahaeloe, na pathim ah; toenghaih hnuksak han ka koeh pongah, lok na thui ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toe lokthuih han na tawn ai nahaeloe, ka lok hae tahngai ah; anghngai duem ah, palunghahaih kang patuk han, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nangcae palungha kaminawk, ka lok hae tahngai oh; panoekhaih tawn kaminawk, naa patueng oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pakha mah caaknaek pataengh baktih toengah, naa mah ni lok to khingh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toenghaih to qoi o si; aimacae han kahoih hmuen to panoek o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Job mah, Kai loe ka toeng, ka toenghaih Sithaw mah ang lak pae ving boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai loe ka toeng, toe amsawnlok thui kami ah ka oh, sakpazaehaih ka tawn ai, toe kahoih thai ai nathaih hoiah ka oh, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Job hoi anghmong kami mi maw kaom, kasaethuihaih to tui baktih kanae mi maw kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih loe kahoih ai hmuen sah kaminawk hoiah amyok moe, kasae kaminawk hoiah angkom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sithaw nuiah anghoehaih mah kami han amekhaih tidoeh paek ai, tiah Job mah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To pongah panoekhaih tawn kaminawk, ka lok hae tahngai oh; Sithaw loe hmuen kasae sah mak ai, Thacak Angraeng loe hmuen sakpazaehaih roe tawn mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kami mah sak ih hmuen baktih toengah Sithaw mah pathok, angmah ih tuinuen baktih toengah, a nuiah phaksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ue, Sithaw loe natuek naa ah doeh kasae hmuen to sah mak ai; Thacak Angraeng loe toenghaih to paqoi ving mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi mah maw anih to long khenzawnkung hoi long boih ukkung ah suek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kami nuiah Sithaw palungphui moe, angmah ih Muithla hoi a hinghaih takhi to la ving nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kaminawk loe nawnto anghma o boih tih, kami loe maiphu ah amlaem let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaihi panoekhaih na tawnh nahaeloe, khopoek ah; ka thuih ih lok hae tahngai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toenghaih hnuma kami mah uk thai tih maw? Thacak toenghaih hoi lokcaekkung to kasae thui thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang khaeah, Nang loe tidoeh avang ai, angraengnawk khaeah, Nangcae loe kahoih ai kami ni, tiah thui thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toe anih loe angraengnawk ih mikhmai to khen ai, amtang kaminawk pongah loe angraeng kaminawk ni mikhmai paek kue, tiah om ai; nihcae loe Sithaw mah ni sak boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nihcae loe nawnetta ah duek o; kaminawk loe qum taning ah tasoeh o moe, laemh o boih; thacak kaminawk doeh kami ih ban hoi na ai ah laemh o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sithaw mah loe kami caehhaih loklam to khet moe, a khok tangkannawk doeh hnuk boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zaehaih sah kaminawk anghawk ving thaihaih khoving hoi duekhaih tahlip to om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lokcaek hanah kami mah Sithaw hmaa ah caeh naah, anih mah kami lokcaekhaih ani to khaeh han angai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lokduenghaih om ai ah thacak kaminawk to a vah phaeng moe, nihcae zuengah kalah kaminawk to a suek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nihcae mah sak ih hmuennawk to anih mah panoek boih pongah, khovingsak moe, amrosak boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nihcae loe angmacae sethaih baktih toengah minawk hmaa ah danpaek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nihcae loe Sithaw to caeh o taak moe, anih ih loklamnawk to tiah doeh poek o ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />to tiah sak o pongah amtang kaminawk qahhaih lok to Angraeng hmaa ah phak moe, pacaekthlaek kaminawk hanghaih lok to anih mah thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah anghngai taak duem nahaeloe, mi mah maw raihaih paek thai tih, a mikhmai hawk ving nahaeloe, mi kawbaktih kami hoi prae kaminawk mah maw, anih to hnu thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />To tiah kaminawk thaang pongah amansak han ai ah, Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk to danpaek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kami maeto mah Sithaw khaeah, Kai loe thuitaekhaih ka tongh boeh pongah, ka zae let mak ai boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />ka hnu ai ih hmuen to na patuk ah; zaekhaih ka sakpazae boeh nahaeloe, zaehaih ka sah let mak ai boeh, tiah thuih han om ai maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />To hmuen loe na poekhaih baktiah maw om tih? Kai na ai ni, na pahnawt cadoeh, na qoih cadoeh, Sithaw mah pathok let tih, to pongah na panoek ih baktiah thui ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Panoekhaih tawn kaminawk mah kai han na thui o nasoe loe, palungha kaminawk mah ka lok hae tahngai o nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Job loe panoekhaih tawn ai ah lok to thuih; a thuih ih loknawk loe palunghahaih om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Job loe panoekhaih tawn ai kaminawk baktiah lokthuih pongah, anih to boeng khoek to tanoek han ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zaehaih sak khue na ai ah lokaekhaih doeh oh, aicae salakah ban to tabaeng moe, pop parai Sithaw kasae thuihaih lok to a thuih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hae lok loe toeng, tiah na poek maw? Sithaw pongah ka toeng kue, tiah na poek maw? tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang mah, Tih amekhaih maw na hnu tih? Nang mah, Tih atho maw ka hak tih? Zaehaih ka sah ai pongah tih atho maw ka hak tih? tiah na thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah hoi nam puinawk khaeah lok pathim han ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vannawk ho doeng ah loe, khenah, nang pongah kasang kue tamainawk ho khenah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na zae nahaeloe, na zaehaih mah kawbangmaw Sithaw raihaih paek? Na zaehaih pop parai nahaeloe, to zaehaih mah Sithaw kawbangmaw amrosak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Katoeng kami ah na oh pongah, Anih hanah tih hmuen maw na paek boeh? To tih ai boeh loe na ban hoiah Anih mah tih hmuen maw talawk vai boeh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na sak ih sethaih mah nang baktih kami to raihaih paek; na toenghaih mah loe kami capa han amekhaih ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paroeai pacaekthlaekhaih tongh naah, nihcae mah tahmenhaih hnik o, Thacak Sithaw ih ban pongah nihcae mah abomhaih to hnik o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toe mi mah doeh, Aqum ah laa paekkung, kai sahkung Sithaw loe naa ah maw oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />long ih moinawk pong pop kue ah aicae patukkung, van ih tavaanawk pongah aicae palungha kue ah sahkung loe naa ah maw oh? tiah thui o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kasae kaminawk hoi amoek kaminawk lawkthuihaih lok Sithaw mah pathim pae ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sithaw mah avang ai kaminawk tahmenhnikhaih lok to tahngai pae mak ai; Thacak Sithaw mah to baktih loknawk to tiah doeh sah pae mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sithaw ka hnu ai, tiah na thuih cadoeh, anih hmaa ah lokcaekhaih to oh pongah, nang loe anih nuiah amha ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihi loe palung a phuihaih hoiah dan na paek mak ai; sakpazaehaih to pakuem khruek mak ai boeh, tiah a poek pongah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Job loe avang ai lok to thuih moe, panoekhaih tawn ai ah pop parai loknawk to a thuih, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu mah doeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na zing kue raeh, kang patuek han, Sithaw zuengah lokthuih han ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kangthla parai ahmuen hoiah palunghahaih to ka hak, kai sahkung loe toeng, tiah kam tuengsak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangtang ni amsawnlok ka thui mak ai; panoekhaih hoi akoep kami loe na taengah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw loe thacak, toe mi kawbaktih doeh khet patoekhaih tawn ai; anih loe thacakhaih, palunghahaih hoiah akoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kahoih ai kami ih hinghaih to anih mah patawn pae ai, toe amtang kaminawk loe toenghaih hoiah lok a caek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anih loe katoeng kami to angqoi taak ai, siangpahrangnawk salakah anghnutsak, ue, nihcae to caksak poe moe, kasang ah atoengh tahang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nihcae to qui hoiah pathlet o moe, pacaekthlaekhaih qui mah taoeng caeng nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih mah nihcae sethaih hoi sakpazae ih hmuennawk to thuih pae, nihcae amoekhaih to amtuengsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuitaekhaih lok tahngai koehhaih palungthin to paongh pae moe, kasae sakhaih caeh taak hanah a thuih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nihcae mah lok to tahngai o moe, a tok to sah o nahaeloe, hing thung khosakhoih o ueloe, kamongah om o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toe nihcae mah anih ih lok to tahngai o ai nahaeloe, sumsen hoi anghmaa o tih, panoekhaih om ai ah dueh o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sithaw panoek ai angsahcop kaminawk loe palung thungah palungphui o; Anih mah qui hoi pathlet naah doeh tahmenhaih hni o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nihcae loe thendoeng nathuem ah duek o moe, kaciim ai kaminawk hoi nawnto a duek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih mah patangkhang amtang kaminawk to loisak, raihaih a tongh o naah thaih kophaih to a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih mah loklam tamcaek ahmuen hoiah lam tamcaek kaom ai ahmuen kakawk ah na suem ueloe, na caboi nuiah caaknaek kahoih koimongah na patoemh pae tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toe nang loe zaehaih pongah lokcaekhaih na tongh boeh; na sak ih zaehaih atho lokcaekhaih to na tong tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Palungphui pongah, danpaekhaih oh han ai ah acoe ah; akranghaih atho paek mang cadoeh na loih thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang raenghaih hmuenmae mah na bomh thai tih maw? Sui hoi na thacakhaih ah kaom pop parai hmuenmaenawk to na paek cadoeh, na bomh thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khoving to zing hmah; kaminawk loe aqum ah ni angmacae ohhaih ahmuen hoiah anghmat o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zaehaih thungah amlaem let han ai, acoe ah; patangkhanghaih pongah to hmuen to ni na koeh kue boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw loe a thacakhaih hoiah pakoeh ah oh boeh; anih baktih patukkung mi maw kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi mah maw a caehhaih loklam anih han patuek vaih? To ai boeh loe mi mah maw sakpazaehaih na tawnh, tiah naa vaih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kaminawk loe a sak o ih hmuen to laasakhaih hoiah pakoeh o, nang doeh pakoeh toeng han pahnet hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kami boih mah anih toksakhaih to hnuk o; kami mah kangthla hoiah khen thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khenah, Sithaw loe Len parai; anih to aicae mah panoek thai ai; anih hinghaih saningnawk doeh kroek thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih loe kaca tui to van ah azuh tahang moe, tamai to khotui ah angcoengsak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tamai thung hoiah tui to krak moe, kami nuiah pop parai kho to angzohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anih mah kawbangmaw tamai to anghaehsak moe, kawbangmaw ohhaih ahmuen hoiah khopazihsak, tiah panoek kami oh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khenah, anih loe a ohhaih ranuiah aanghaih to suek moe, kathuk koek tuipui talae doeh a kraeng khoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />To tiah kaminawk to lokcaek moe, kamthlai pokah caaknaek to a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tamai hoiah aanghaih to kraeng moe, patoep ih ahmuen to kah hanah lok a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anih ih khopazih tuen mah takhi sae song tih boeh, tiah panoeksak, maitaw mah doeh takhi sae song tih, tiah panoek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hae hmuen pongah ka palungthin tasoeh moe, a ohhaih ahmuen hoiah angthuih ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thuih ih lok, anih ih pakha thung hoiah tacawt lok to kahoih ah tahngai ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thuih ih lok loe van tlim ah kaom ahmuen boih ah phak moe, tangphrapuekhaih doeh long boenghaih ahmuen khoek to phak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangphrapuek pacoengah lok to angzoh; a lensawkhaih lok hoiah kho to pazisak; lok tacawt pacoengah loe, takhi sae songhaih diisak let mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dawnrai koi kaom ah Sithaw mah khopazih lok to tacawtsak; aicae mah panoek thai ai ih kalen parai hmuennawk to anih mah sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dantui khaeah, Long ah krah ah, tiah a naa. Khotui khaeah, Kalen parai kho angzoh hanah lok a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kami boih mah a sak ih hmuen panoek thai hanah, kami boih mah sak ih tok to anghaksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taw ih moinawk loe akhaw thungah caeh o moe, athung ah abuep o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aloih bang hoiah takhi kamhae to angzoh moe, aluek bang hoiah kangqai to angzoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sithaw ih takhi mah hmuh pongah, tui to amkhawk, kawk parai tuinawk loe amkhawk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamai to tui hoiah koisak moe, ni aengh mah tamai to angkhoengsak phaeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Long ah kaom hmuennawk boih loe, a thuih ih lok baktih toengah, sak o hanah a thuih ih lok hoiah ni amhae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaminawk thuitaek han ih, to tih ai boeh loe angmah ih long to khetzawn han ih, to tih ai boeh loe palungnathaih amtuengsak han ih, to tiah ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Job hae lok hae tahngai ah; dawnrai koi kaom Sithaw ih hmuennawk hae, anghngaih duem ah loe, poek ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sithaw mah kawbangmaw tamainawk to amzamsak moe, aanghaih to ohsak, tiah na panoek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Palunghahaih hoi kakoep, dawnrai koi kaom, Sithaw mah sak ih hmuen ah kaom, tamainawk to kawbangmaw amzamsak, tito na panoek vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aloih bang ih takhi mah long to betsak naah, na khukbuen to kawbangmaw bet, tiah na panoek vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sithaw mah kabae amdingsak hanah tamai to taboksak, nang loe to tiah na sak thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih khaeah timaw ka thuih o han, tito na patuk ah; khoving pongah tidoeh ka sah o thai ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lokthuih ka koeh, tiah Anih khaeah ka thuih han maw? Kami mah to tiah thui nahaeloe, to kami to anih mah amrosak tangtang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Takhi song moe, tamai to hmuh phaeng naah, mi mah doeh ni aengh to khen thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih loe kampha sui baktiah aluek bang hoiah angzoh; Sithaw loe zitthok Lensawkhaih hoiah akoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thacak Sithaw loe aicae mah hnu thai ai; anih loe thacakhaih, lokcaekhaih hoi toenghaih hoiah akoep; anih loe mi kawbaktih doeh pacaekthlaek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />To pongah kaminawk mah anih to zit o; anih loe palungha kami ni, tiah poek ih kaminawk khingyahaih to tawn ai, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Angraeng mah takhi kamhae thung hoiah Job ih lok to pathim pae, anih khaeah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />panoekhaih tawn ai ah thuih ih lok hoiah khoving baktiah omsak kami loe mi aa?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaihi nongpa baktiah kaeng to angzaeng ah; kang dueng ih lok hae na pathim ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Long angdoethaih akung ka sak nathuem ah naa ah maw na oh? Na panoek nahaeloe, na thui ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi mah maw long tahhaih qui to sak? To tih ai boeh loe mi mah maw a nuiah tahhaih qui to payang? Na panoek nahaeloe pathim ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Long angdoethaih akung to naa ah maw a paeh? To tih ai boeh loe im takii ih thlung loe mi mah maw tlingh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawnbang cakaehnawk nawnto laasak o moe, Sithaw caanawk anghoehaih hoiah hangh o nathuem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe amno zok thung hoiah tuipui tacawt moe, tapok naah, mi mah maw tuipui thok khah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamai ka sak naah, kathah parai vinghaih hoiah ka khuk moe, ka yaw hmoek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />angzithaih ramri to ka suek pae, thok hoi takraenghaih thing to ka suek pae moe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hae karoek to ni nang zoh thaih, hae ahmuen hae na poeng mak ai; nam oekhaih tuiphu loe hae ah boengsak ah, tiah ka naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hing thung akhawnbang hanah lok na paek vai moe, akhawnbang khodai hanah angmah ih ahmuen to na patuek vai maw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />akhawnbang khodai mah long boenghaih to patawnh moe, kasae kaminawk tasoehsak maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Long loe catui daeng ih baktiah krang to amtueng moe, khukbuen pong ih krang baktih toengah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kasae kaminawk aanghaih loe anghmat moe, payangh ih ban doeh angkhaeh pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipui tacawthaih akhaw thungah na kun moe, kathuk koek ahmuen ah na caeh vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang hanah duekhaih khongkha to paong vai maw? To tih ai boeh loe duekhaih tahlip ih thoknawk to na hnuk vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kawk parai long hae na panoek vai maw? Na panoek boih nahaeloe, na thui ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aanghaih ahmuen phakhaih loklam loe naa ah maw oh? Vinghaih ahmuen loe naa ah maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khoving khodai ohhaih ahmuen ah nihcae to na hoi thai tih maw? To hmuennawk ohhaih loklam to na panoek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang loe na tapen boeh, to tih ai boeh loe saning paroeai na hing boeh pongah, na panoek han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dantui kamkhawk suekhaih imthung ah na kun vai maw? To tih ai boeh loe qaetui patunghaih ahmuen to na hnuk vai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />To hmuennawk loe raihaih tue, misa angkahhaih hoi misa angtukhaih tue nathuem han ih na ai maw ka suek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aanghaih loe naa ih loklam hoiah maw aang, to tih ai boeh loe ni angyae bang ih takhi loe naa bang ih loklam hoiah maw song?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tui longhaih loklam to paqoi moe, tangphrapuekhaih loklam sahkung loe mi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi mah maw kami om ai praezaek hoi kami om ai, long ah kho angzosak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Long karoem, pahnawt sut ih long ah, qam kanawk hoi phro amprawksak hanah mi mah maw sak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khotui loe ampa tawnh maw? To tih ai boeh loe mi mah maw dantui ohsak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kamkhawk tui loe mi ih zok thung hoiah maw tacawt? Van hoi krah tathuk dantui loe mi ih zok thung hoiah maw tacawt?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuinawk loe siktue naah thlung baktiah amkhawk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kranghoih Pleiades cakaehnawk to qui hoi na zaeng thai maw? Nawnto kangpop Orion cakaehnawk ih qui to na khram thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Atue phak naah Mazzaroth cakaehnawk to na zaeh thai maw? To tih ai boeh loe Akturus to a caanawk hoi nawnto na zaeh thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Van ukhaih daan to na panoek maw? To baktih daan hoiah long uk hanah na sak thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pop parai tui ang kraih pae hanah, tamai to lok na paek thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tangphra na pueksak thai maw? Nihcae mah nang khaeah, Hae ah ka oh o, tiah na thui o ueloe, caeh o tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi mah maw palunghahaih hoi panoek thaihaih palungthin to paek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tamai kroek thaih palungha mi maw kaom? Maiphu loe amtaak moe, longnawk nawnto amhlom o naah, van ih pailangnawk krai thaih mi maw kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kaipui hanah moi na zoep pae thai maw? To tih ai boeh loe saning nawk kaipui zok nam hahsak thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nihcae loe thlungkhaw thungah tabok o moe, kapring thung hoiah moi angang o naah, na pacah thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pangaah ih caanawk loe rawkcaak tawn ai ah amhet o moe, Sithaw khaeah hang o naah, mi mah maw rawkcaak pacah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sathar caa tapenhaih atue na panoek maw? To tih ai boeh loe tasuk caa tapenhaih atue na panoek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ca tapen karoek to khrah nazetto maw zokpomh, tito na panoek maw? To tih ai boeh loe nihcae tapenhaih atue na panoek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nihcae loe tabok o, caa tapen o; to naah caa tapenhaih kana to pahnet o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A caanawk loe ngantui o moe, taw ah qoeng o tahang; amno to caeh o taak, amlaem o let ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi mah maw taw ih hrangnawk angmah koeh ah prasak? Mi mah maw taw hrang ih aqui to khramh pae thaih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih ohhaih ahmuen to praezaek ah ka sak moe, karoem long to anih ohhaih ahmuen ah ka paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anih loe vangpui thung ih loknawk to pahnuithuih moe, kamongh kami hanghaih lok doeh tahngai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih loe maenawk nuiah prat moe, kahing phrohnawk to pakrong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmawsaeng taw ih maitaw loe na tok to sak moe, nang khaeah oh han koeh tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laikok toksak hanah qui hoiah na zae thai tih maw? To tih ai boeh loe laikok atok hanah na hnukah bang thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih thacakhaih to na oep han maw? To tih ai boeh loe na sak ih tok to anih khaeah na aap thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih mah im ah cang na phaw pae ueloe, tapup thungah na suem pae tih, tiah na tang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tawtaaw tavaa loe amoekhaih hoiah pakhraeh to boh, toe tahnongsawk tavaa hoi Ostrich tavaa loe anih ih amui hoiah patah thai ai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />anih loe long ah taduih moe, savuet long hoiah tadui to khaeksak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />anih loe khok hoiah angmah ih tadui to cawh moeng ueloe, taw ih moi mah tadui koisak moeng tih, tito panoek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih loe a caanawk to angmah ih caa ai baktiah khet, anih caasakhaih loe azom pui ni, tiah poek ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sithaw mah anih han palunghahaih to paek ai, panoekhaih roe paek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toe pakhraeh atoengh tahang naah, anih mah hrang hoi a nuiah kangthueng kami to pahnuithuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hrang tha na caksak maw? Anih ih tahnong to na khuk pae maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pakhuh kangphet baktiah maw nang phetsak? Anih anghahaih takhi tuen loe zit thoh parai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih loe azawn ah cawnh tapaih, a thacakhaih to angoep moe, misatuh kaminawk to a hmaang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zithaih to pahnuithuih, zithaih tidoeh tawn ai; sumsen doeh cawn taak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih kahhaih palaa tuen to tacawt, tayae hoi misa angvaenghaih aphaw loe ampha hlip.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih loe palungphui moe, thacakhaih palung hoiah long to a caak; mongkah lok a thaih naah, om duem thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mongkah lok thaih naah, Ha, ha, tiah a thuih; misatuh angraeng ih lok, misa pahruekhaih lok ahmui loe ahmuen kangthla hoiah panoek thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tahmu loe na patuk ih palunghahaih hoiah pakhraeh to boh moe, aloih bangah azawk tathuk maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tahmu loe na paek ih lok pongah maw van bangah azawk tahang moe, hmuensang ah tabu to boh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anih loe lungsong nuiah oh, cathaeng loe anih ohhaih kacak ahmuen ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />To ahmuen hoiah a khet moe, caak koi moi to ahmuen kangthla hoiah hnuk thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A caanawk doeh athii to pazoh o toeng; anih loe kadueh qok ohhaih ahmuen ah oh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Angraeng mah Job khaeah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thacak Angraeng mah thuitaek ih kami loe lok angaek vop tih maw? Sithaw kasaethui kami mah pathim nasoe, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To naah Job mah, Angraeng khaeah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khenah, kai loe tidoeh avang ai kami ah ka oh; kawbangmaw nang kang pathim thai tih? Ka ban hoiah pakha ka tamuep khoep han boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lok vaito ka thuih, toe ka pathim mak ai: ue, vai hnetto ka thuih moeng boeh; toe ka thui let mak ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To naah Angraeng mah takhi thung hoiah Job khaeah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />nongpa baktiah kaengkaeh to angzaeng ah; kang dueng ih lok hae na pathim ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lokcaekhaih na phraek han maw? Na toeng thai hanah, kai zaehaih nang net han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sithaw baktiah ban na tawnh maw? Anih baktiah khopazih tuen na tacawtsak thai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na tacawtsak thaih nahaeloe, lensawkhaih hoi azathaih to angkhuk ah loe, lensawkhaih hoi kranghoihhaih hoiah amthoep ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Palung na phuihaih to pakhrawt ah; amoek kaminawk to khenh loe, pahnaem tathuk ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amoek kaminawk to khenh loe, ahnaemsak ah; kasae kaminawk to angmacae angdoethaih ahmuen ah atii ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nihcae to maiphu thungah nawnto aphum ah, nihcae ih mikhmai to khoving thungah khuk ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />To tiah na sak nahaeloe na bantang mah nangmah to pahlong thai tih, tiah ka thuih han, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang hoi nawnto ka sak ih, Behemoth to khenah, anih loe maitaw baktiah qam to caak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khenah, anih thacakhaih loe kaeng ah oh moe, a zok hin ah doeh thacakhaih to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih ih tamai loe Sidar thing baktiah ahaek, a phaih thaquinawk loe nawnto angbok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih ih ahuhnawk loe sumboeng kamling baktiah oh moe, anih ih panakhuhnawk loe sum baktiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih loe Sithaw mah sak ih hmuen thungah hmaloe koekah oh; toe anih sahkung mah anih to angmah ih sumsen hoiah hmang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mae nuiah kapra moi loe anih ih rawkcaak ah oh, taw ih moinawk loe to ahmuen ah prat o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih loe kahoih tahlip thingkung tlim ah tabok moe, tangnong ohhaih ahmuen ah kamprawk akung tlim ah anghawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />To thingkung tahlip mah anih to khuk moe, vacong ah kamprawk akungnawk mah anih to takui o khoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khenah, anih loe kalen tuipui to tiah doeh sah ai; Jordan vapui anih ih pakha khoek to pha aep to mah angoephaih to a tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih to naeh thai tih maw? Thaang pongah amansak ueloe, a hnah to daw pae thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leviathan to cakoih hoi na tathok thai tih maw? To tih ai boeh loe anih ih palai to qui hoiah na pathlet pae thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnah to na daw pae moe, anih ih akam huh to cakoih hoiah na taqawt pae thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih mah tahmenhaih na hni ueloe, nang khaeah lok kanaem to thui tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih loe hing thung na tamna ah oh hanah, nang khaeah lokmaihaih sah tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih to tavaa hoi amhai baktiah nam hai haih han maw? To tih ai boeh loe nangmah ih nongpatanawk hanah anih to qui hoiah na pathlet pae han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nam puinawk mah anih han buhraenghaih sah pae tih maw? Anih to hmuen zaw kaminawk khaeah athum o sak tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sum kamsum hoiah anih ih ahin to na thunh thai tih maw? To tih ai boeh loe a lu to tanga thunhaih tayae hoiah na thunh thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih nuiah ban to mah koeng ah, anih tuk hanah poek hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khenah, anih pazawk han poekhaih loe azom pui ni; anih hnu kami loe amthaek bup mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih to mi mah doeh pahrue thai mak ai; to tiah om nahaeloe mi maw ka hmaa ah angdoe thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sak pathok let hanah mi mah maw na pakaa thai tih? Van tlim ih hmuennawk boih loe kai ih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leviathan ih khokbannawk, a thacakhaih hoi kahoih takpumnawk thui ai ah ka om thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi mah maw anih ih ahin to khok pae thai tih? Mi mah maw anih ih akam huh to cakoih hoi tathok hanah a taengah caeh thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi mah maw anih ih mikhmai thok to paong pae thai tih? Anih ih haanawk loe zit thoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kacak ah catui daeng baktih toengah, kangbok a nui ih ahin loe anih amoekhaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Takhi akun thaih han ai ah, ahin maeto hoi maeto angbet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahin maeto hoi maeto angbet moe, kacakah angbet caeng pongah khram thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih pasih naah hmai ampha, a mik loe akhawn bangah pakhrip ih mik baktiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih ih pakha thung hoiah hmai aengh hoi hmai kangqong to tacawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui tangdawh thlukbuk laom thung hoi tacawt hmaikhue baktih toengah, a hnakhaw thung hoiah hmaikhue to tacawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih anghahhaih takhi mah hmaisaae to amngaehsak moe, anih ih pakha thung hoiah kangqong hmai to tacawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih ih tahnong ah thacakhaih to oh, anih hmaa ah loe palungsethaih to anghoehaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih ih ngan thaquinawk loe nawnto amraep o, angthui thai ai, cakrap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih ih palung loe thlung baktiah amtak; ue, cang kaehhaih thlung baktiah amtak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anih angthawk tahang naah, thacak kaminawk loe zithaih hoiah oh o; anih tamai boh naah om o thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anih loe sumsen mah caa ai; tayae, palaa hoi ahnuk ahma kamsum tayae mah doeh caa ai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To naah Job mah Angraeng khaeah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hmuennawk boih na sak thaih, tito ka panoek; hmuen sak han nam sakhaih mi mah doeh pakaa thai ai, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Panoekhaih tawn ai ah ka thuih ih lok anghmasak kami loe mi aa? tiah lok nang dueng; kai loe ka panoek ai ih loknawk, ka panoek ai ih hmuennawk hoi paroeai dawnrai koi hmuennawk to ka thuih moeng boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang mah, Tahngai ah, lok kang thuih han; kang dueng ih lok to na pathim ah, tiah nang naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thuih ih lok to ka naa mah thaih boeh, vaihi ka mik mah nang to hnuk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To pongah kaimah hoi kaimah hae panuet moe, dawnpakhuemhaih amtuengsak hanah, maiphu hoi vaipoep nuiah kang hnut boeh, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Angraeng mah Job khaeah hae loknawk thuih pacoengah, Angraeng mah Teman acaeng Eliphaz khaeah, Nang hoi nam pui hnik nuiah palung ka phui; ka tamna Job mah thuih ih lok baktiah, loktang ah kaom kai kawng to na thui hoi ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To pongah vaihi maitaw tae sarihto hoi tuu tae sarihto lak pacoengah, ka tamna Job khaeah caeh oh loe, nangmacae hanah hmai angbawnhaih to sah oh; ka tamna Job mah nangcae han lawk na thui pae tih; anih lawkthuihaih to ka talawk pae han; toe ka tamna Job mah thuih ih lok baktiah, loktang ah kaom kai kawng to na thui hoi ai pongah, nam thu o haih atho to kang pathok han, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To pongah, Teman acaeng Eliphaz, Shuh acaeng Bildad hoi Namaath acaeng Zophar cae loe caeh o moe, Angraeng mah thuih ih lok baktih toengah a sak o; to naah Angraeng mah Job lawkthuihaih to tahngaih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Job mah ampuinawk han lawkthuih pae pacoengah, Angraeng mah canghniah tawnh ih hmuen pongah alet hnetto kamtlai ah angraenghaih to paek let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To pacoengah angmah ih nawkamyanawk, a tanunawk, ampui kangzongnawk anih khaeah angzoh o moe, a im ah anih hoi nawnto buhcaakhaih to a sak o; Angraeng mah anih nuiah phaksak ih raihaih pongah nihcae mah anih to palungset o haih moe, pathloep o; nihcae boih mah sum kanglung phoisa hoi sui bantuek maeto anih hanah paqum pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnukkhuem ah loe Angraeng mah Job hanah hmaloe ih pongah kamtlai ah tahamhoihaih to paek pongah, tuu sang hatlai palito, kaengkuu hrang sang tarukto, laikok atok thaih maitaw tae sangto hoi laa hrang sangto a tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anih mah capa sarihto hoi canu thumto sak let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Canu kacoeh loe Jemima, hnetto haih loe Kezia, thumto haih loe Keren-Happuh, tiah ahmin phui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Prae thung boih ah Job canu baktih kranghoih nongpata mi doeh om ai; nihcae ih ampa Job loe a canunawk hanah, nihcae ih thangqoi nongpanawk hoi kangvan ah qawk to pazet pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To pacoengah Job loe saning cumvai, quipalito hing; a caanawk hnuk pacoengah, a caanawk ih caa patoeng, adung pali karoek to hnuk vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Job loe saning akoep moe, mitong naah duek.
  </para>
</usx>
